<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">2 Chronicles</book>
  <para style="h">2 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Chronicles</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida fapa Solomona chu a ram chhûngah chuan tihchakin a awm a, Lalpa a Pathian chu a hnênah a awm a, nasa takin a tiropui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Israel-ho zawng zawng, sipai sâng hotu te, za hotu te, rorêltu te, Israel ram zawng zawnga mi lian, chhûngkaw puipa zawng zawng chu a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona leh inkhâwmho zawng zawng chu Gibeon khuaa hmun sângah chuan an kal a; chutah chuan Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosian thlalêra a siam Pathian biakna bûk kha a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian bâwm erawh chu Davidan a lo buatsaih tawhna hmunah Kiriath-jearim aṭangin Davida chuan a lo la chho tawh a; Jerusalem-ah a dahna tûr puan in a lo zâr sa tawh rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Hura fa Uria fapa Bezalela siam dâr maichâm kha Lalpa biakna bûk bulah chuan a awm bawk a; tin, Solomona leh mipuihote chuan an va pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomona chu inbiakna puan in bula dâr maichâm awmna Lalpa hmaah chuan a han chho va, hâlral thilhlan sângkhat a han hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Solomona hnênah Pathian a inlâr a, a hnênah, “Eng nge ka pêk ang che, mi dîl rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Pathian hnênah, “Ka pa Davida hnênah khân khawngaihna nasa tak i lantîr a, a aiawhin lalah mi lo siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, aw Lalpa Pathian, ka pa Davida hnêna i thutiam kha tipuitling ang che; nangin vaivut zât zet mipuite lalah mi lo siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng mipuiho hmaa lût leh chhuaka ka awm theih nân finna leh hriatna mi han pe ang che; i mi heti zozai hi tuin nge rorêlsak thei ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Solomona hnênah, “Hetiang rilru i puta, sum leh pai te, hausakna te, chawimawina te, nangmah hawtu che nunna te dîl lova, dam reina te pawh dîl lova, an chunga lala ka siamna che ka mite ro i rêlsak theihna tûra finna leh hriatnate mi dîl zâwk avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />finna leh hriatna chu pêk i ni tawh e; tin, i hmaa lalte pawhin an la neih ngai loh, i hnu pawha an neih hauh loh tûr sum leh pai te, hausakna te, chawimawinate ka pe bawk ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chu hmun sâng bula biak bûk awmna Gibeon khuaa a zin chu Jerusalem-ah a haw a, Israel-te chungah ro a rêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan tawlailîrte leh sakawr chung chuang mite a khâwm chiam a; tawlailîr sângkhat leh zali leh sakawr chung chuang mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih a nei a, chûng chu tawlailîr dahna khuaah te, Jerusalem khuaa lal awmnaah te chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Jerusalem khuaah chuan rangkachak leh tangkaruate chu lung ang maia ngaih khawpin a dah ṭeuh va, sidar thingte chu phaia theipui thing ang leka ngaih khawpin a dah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Solomona neih sakawrte chu Aigupta ram ata rawn tawlh chhuah a ni a; lal sumdâwngtute chuan chûng chu a rual rualin an lo khâr ṭhîn a, a ruala lei zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta rama mi tawlailîrte chu tangkarua sekel zaruk zêlin an tithleng ṭhîn a; tin, sakawrte chu tangkarua sekel za leh sawmnga zêlin; chutiang bawk chuan Hit-ho lal zawng zawng leh Suria lalte pawh an tihthlensak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Lalpa hming tân in sak a tum a, lal in tûr nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomona chuan thil phur mi sîngsarih leh, tlânga thing kittu sîngriat leh anmahni vêngtu sângthum leh zaruk a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Tura lal Hurama hnênah, “Ka pa Davida thil i lo tihsaka, a awmna tûr in sak nân sidar te i lo thawh ang khân mi tihsak ve ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa ka Pathian tân in sak ka tum ta a. Chu in chu rimtui hâla Lalpa biakna hmun, Israel-te hnêna tih tûr thupêk ding reng - chhangdah hlan te, Chawlhni leh thla thar leh Lalpa kan Pathian hminga kût nitea zîngah leh tlaia hâlral thilhlan hlan rengna tûr a ni ang. Hêngte hi Israel-te tâna kumkhaw thuruat chu a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ka in sak tum hi ropui tak tûr a ni a, kan Pathian hi pathian zawng zawng aia ropui a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vân zau tak pawha leng lo Pathian chu tu mân in an saksak thei lo vang a. Kei tehlul hian rimtui hâla amah biak nân chauh lo chuan engtin nge in ka saksak theih ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a mi themthiamte ka pa Davidan a lo rawih ṭhin, tûna ka hnêna awmte zînga thawk ve tûr hian mi pakhat, rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te, thîr lam te khawih thei, puan sen duk te, sen lâr te, dumpâwl te siam thiam, ziak eng ang pawh thiam mî, rawn tîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lebanon-a mi sidar thing te, fâr thing te, algum thing te pawh mi han thawn ang che; i miten Lebanon-a thing kih an thiam hle tih ka hre si a; tichuan, ngai teh, thing tam tak mi buatsaihsak tûrin ka mite chu i mite zîngah tel ve rawh se; ka in sak tum hi in ropui tak tûr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, i mi, thing kittute chu chhangphut tehkhâwng sînghnih leh barli tehkhâwng sînghnih leh uain bath sînghnih leh hriak bath sînghnih ka pe ang e,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Tura lal Hurama chuan, “ Lalpan a mite a hmangaih avângin an lalah a siam che a nih hi,” tiin, Solomona chu lehkhain a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hurama chuan, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, lei leh vân siamtu, Lalpa in leh lal in sa tûra finna leh hriatna nei fapa fing tak Lal Davida petu chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi themthiam, finna leh hriatna nei, Dana thlaha mi hmeichhe pakhat fa, a hming Hurama ka rawn tîr e; a pa chu Tura khuaa mi, rangkachak lam te, tangkaraw lam te, dâr lam te, thîr lam te, lung lam te, thing lam te, puan sen duk te, dumpâwl te, puan zai sîn te, sen lâr te deh thiam, ziak eng ang pawh thiam, thiam tinrêng thiam a ni a; i mi themthiamho leh ka pu i pa Davida themthiamho zîngah chuan a rawn thawk ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, buh te, barli te, hriak te, uain thûte ka lalpan a sawi chu chhiahhlawhte chu rawn thawn ang hmiang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tichuan, keinin Lebanon-a thing chu i duh zât zât kan lo kit ang a, tuifinriatah Jopa thlengin kan rawn tawlhsak ang chia; tin, nangin Jerusalem-ah i thiar chho dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Israel rama a pa Davidan a lo chhiar tawh sa, hnam dang mi zawng zawng chu a chhiar a, nuai khat leh sîngnga leh sângthum leh zaruk an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, thil phur mi sîngsarih leh tlânga thing kittu sîngriat leh, mipuite thawh dân rêlbâwlsaktu tûr sângthum leh zaruk a ruat a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chuan Jerusalem-ah, Moria tlâng, a pa Davida hnêna Lalpa inlârna, Jebus mi Ornana hruih zâwl, Davidan hmun a lo buatsaih saah chuan Lalpa in chu a sa ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lal kum li kum, thla hnihna, ni hnih niin a sa ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in sak dân tûr Solomonan a han rêl dân chu hetiang hi a ni: a dung lam chu tawng teh dân hluiin tawng sawmruk a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng sawmhnih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hma lama hulhliap dung lam chu in vâng lam chen bawk, tawng sawmhnih a ni a, a sân lam chu za leh sawmhnih a ni a; a chhûng chu rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, pindan lian zâwk bangah chuan fâr thing a bel a, chu chu rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin a luan a, chutah chuan tûm thing leh khaidiat lem a chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a timawi tûrin in chu lunghlutein a chei a; rangkachak chu Parvaim rangkachak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In chu, a kalkhang te, a bang te, a chhuat te, a kawngkhâr te chu rangkachakin a luan a; bangahte chuan cherub lemte a chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, hmun thianghlim ber a siam a; a dung lam chu in vâng lam chen bawk, tawng sawmhnih a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng sawmhnih a ni a; rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin a luan a, talent zaruk a tling a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a kilhna rih lam chu rangkachak sekel sawmnga a ni. Tin, pindan chungnungte chu rangkachakin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, hmun thianghlim berah chuan cherub lem pahnih a siam a; chûng chu rangkachakin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, cherub thlate chuan tawng sawmhnih a awh a; cherub pakhat thla chu tawng nga a ni a, bang a va thleng a; tin, a thla lehlam pawh chu tawng nga bawk a ni a, cherub pakhat thla chu a va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, cherub pakhat thla pawh chu tawng nga a ni a, bang chu a va thleng a; tin, a thla lehlam chu tawng nga bawk a ni a; cherub pakhat thla chu a va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûng cherub-te chuan tawng sawmhnih awhin an thla an zâr a, an ding a, in chhûng lam hawiin an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr tûr a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr te, la zai sîn taktein a siam a, chutah chuan cherub lemte a chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a hma lamah chuan tawng sawmthum leh tawng ngaa sâng ban pahnih a phun a, chumi chhîp chu tawng nga ve ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi hmunah chuan khaidiat a siam a, ban chhîpte chu a zem a; tin, pawmgranet za a siam a, khaidiatah chuan a khai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, biak in hma lamah chuan bante chu a phun a, pakhat ding lamah, pakhat vei lamah; tin, ding lama mi chu Jakin a ti a, vei lama mi chu Boaz a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, dâr maichâm, a dung lam tawng sawmhnih, a vâng lam tawng sawmhnih, a sân lam tawng sâwm a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dâr zêm bial lian pui, a tlâng leh a tlâng inkâra tawng sâwm tla, a sân lam tawng nga a chhûng bawk a; a tlâng chu tawng sawmthum bial vêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tlâng hnuai chu kuhmûm lemte hian a vêl chhuak a, tawng khatah sâwm zêl, dâr zêm vêl chuan a awm a. Kuhmûm lem chu tlar hnih a ni a, dâr zêma chhûn belhbawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu chu bâwngpa sâwm leh pahnih chungah a innghat a, pathumin hmâr lam an hawi a, pathumin thlang lam an hawi a, pathumin chhim lam an hawi a, pathumin chhak lam an hawi a; hnung lam an inchhawn ṭheuh va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuizêm chu kutphah bawka chhah a ni a, ṭin sângkhat leh zahnih dawng a ni, a tlâng chu no tlâng ang, lili pâr anga siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Insilna tûr maihûn sâwm a siam bawk a, ding lampangah panga a hûng a, vei lampangah panga a hûng a; chûng chu hâlral thilhlan silna tûr a ni a; dâr zêm erawh chu puithiamte insilna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a siam dân tûra ruat angin rangkachak khâwnvâr dahna sâwm chu a siam a, biak in chhûngah chuan ding lamah panga, vei lamah panga a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dawhkân sâwm a siam bawk a, biak in chhûngah chuan ding lamah panga, vei lamah panga a dah a. Tin, rangkachak maihûn za a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng lo pawh chu kawtzâwl, puithiamho ta leh a pâwn zâwkah kawtzâwl zau a siam a, kawngkhârpui a siam bawk a, dârin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, zêm chu in ding lampangah chhak lamah chhim chhawngin a hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Hurama chuan bêl te, vutlawh te, maihûnte a siam a. Chutichuan, Pathian in atâna Lal Solomona a siamsak chu Hurama chuan a peih ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ban pahnih te, bêl anga bâwk te, ban chhîpa bêl anga bâwk pahnih te, ban chhîpa bêl anga bâwk pahnih tuamna ṭial chik chek pahnih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />chumi tuamna ṭial chik chek pahnih atâna pawmgranet zali te, ban chhîpa bêl anga bâwk pahnih tuamna tûr ṭial chik chek ve ve atâna pawmgranet tlar hnih te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hûnchhan te, hûnchhan chunga bêlte pawh a siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />zêm pakhat leh a hnuaia sebâwngpa sâwm leh pahnihte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bêl te, vut lawhna te, sa thurna te leh a bungbêl zawng zawngte pawh chu Hurama chuan Lalpa in atân dâr nawh tlêta Lal Solomona a siamsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûngte chu Jordan phaizâwlah Sukkoth leh Zereda bellei hmunah lal chuan a chhûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Solomonan bungbêl tam tak a siam a; dâr chu bûk sên rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Pathian ina bungbêl awm zawng zawng chu a siam a, rangkachak maichâm te, chhang chhiahna dawhkân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ruat anga hmun thianghlim hmaa chhit tûr khâwnvâr dahna te, a khâwnvâr chawpin, rangkachak hlîr hlakin a siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tin, pangpâr te, khâwnvâr te leh chaichehte chu rangkachak, rangkachak hlîr hlakin a siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tin, khâwnvâr puan chehna te, maihûn te, fian te, mei lâknate chu rangkachak hlîr hlak bawkin; tin, in chhûng luhna, in chhûngril zâwk hmun thianghlim ber kawngkhârte leh a in, biak in kawngkhârte chu rangkachakin a siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Solomona chuan Lalpa in atâna a sak chu a peih ta vek a; tin, Solomona chuan a pa Davidan thil a lo hlan tawh zawng zawng chu a la lût a; tangkarua te, rangkachak te, hmanrua zawng zawngte chu Pathian ina ro dahnaah a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chuan Israel upaho te, an hnam puipa, Israela thlahho chhûngkaw puipa zawng zawng chu, Davida khawpui Zion ata Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm zâwn chho tûrin Jerusalem khuaah a khâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel mi zawng zawng chu thla sarihnaah kûtah chuan lal hnênah an kal khâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Israel upaho zawng zawng chu an lo kal a, Levi-hote chuan bâwm chu an zâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa bâwm leh, inbiakna puan in leh puan ina bungbêl thianghlim zawng zawng chu an zâwn chho va; chûngte chu puithiam Levi-hote chuan an zâwn chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomona leh Israel-ho pung khâwm zawng zawng a hnêna rawn inkhâwmte chu bâwm hmaah an awm ho va, berâm leh bâwngpa sawi sên rual loh leh chhiar sên rual lohvin an inthawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiamte chuan Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm chu a awmna tûrah an la lût a, in chhûnga biakna hmun, hmun thianghlim berah, cherub-te thla hnuaiah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cherub-te chuan bâwm awmna chung zâwnah chuan an thla an zâr reng a, cherub-te chuan bâwm leh a zâwnfungte chu an khuh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a zâwnfungte chu a sei khawp a, a zâwnfung hmâwrte chu biakna hmunhma, hmun thianghlim aṭang chuan a hmuh theih a; amaherawhchu, pâwn lamah zawng a lang lo; tûn thleng hian chutah chuan a la awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata an chhuaha, Lalpan Israela thlahte hnêna thu a thlun laia Mosian Horeb tlânga lungphêk pahnih a dah chauh lo kha chu, chumi bâwm chhûngah chuan eng mah dang a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, puithiamhote chu hmun thianghlim ata an lo chhuah veleh chuan (puithiam awmho zawng zawng chu an intithianghlim a, a pâwlin an insiam chuang lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Levi-ho hla satu zawng zawngte pawh an zavaiin, Asapha te, Hemana te, Jeduthuna te, an fapate leh an unaute nên, puan zai sîna inthuamin dârbenthek te, perhkhuang te, ṭingṭangte nên, maichâm chhak lampangah an ding a, an zîngah chuan puithiam za leh sawmhnih tawtawrâwt hâmin an awm bawk a ni),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />heti hi a ni a, tawtawrâwt hâmtute leh hla satuten Lalpa fakna leh lâwmthu sawi nâna an tum rîk chu ri khat ang maiin a hriat a; tawtawrâwt leh dârbenthek leh thil tum rîk nêna an aw an han chhuaha, “Ani chu a ṭha si a, a ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn a ni,” tia Lalpa an han fak chuanin, Lalpa in chu chhûmin a khat ta mup mup mai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tichuan, chhûm avâng chuan puithiamte chuan rawng pawh an bâwl thei ta lo hial a; Lalpa ropuinain Pathian in chu a khat ta vek si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomonan thu a sawi a: “ Lalpan , ‘Thim chhah mupah chuan ka awm ang,’ a ti tak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nimahsela, i chênna tûr in, kumkhuaa i awmna tûr chu ka lo saksak ta che a nih hi,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a lehhawi a, Israel-ho pung khâwm zawng zawng chu mal a sâwm a; Israel-ho pung khâwm zawng zawng chu an ding ṭhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, ka pa Davida hnêna ama kâ ngeia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Aigupta ram ata ka mi Israel-te ka hruai chhuah ni aṭangin Israel-ho hnam zînga khawii khua mah hi, ka hming awmna tûr in sak nân ka la thlang ngai lo va; ka mi Israel-te chunga hotu tûr mi tu mah ka la thlang ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ka hming awmna tûrin Jerusalem hi ka lo thlang ta a, ka mi Israel-te hotu atân Davida hi ka lo thlang ta a ni,’ tia lo sawitu, ama kut ngeia rawn puitlintu hi fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pa Davida khân Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hming tân in sak a rilrûk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan ka pa Davida hnênah, ‘Ka hming tân in sak i rilrûk ṭhîn a, hetiang rilru i lo pu hi i tiṭha e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nimahsela, nang zawngin in chu i sa lo vang a; i fapa, i ṭhâlbea la chhuak tûra chuan ka hming tân in chu a la sa zâwk ang,’ a lo ti tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a thusawi chu a rawn hlen ta a; Lalpa lo tiam tawh ang ngeiin ka pa Davida hmun chu ka lo luah a, Israel lalṭhutthlêngah chuan ka lo ṭhu a, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hming tân in chu ka lo sa ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutah chuan Israela thlahte hnêna a lo thlun, Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm chu ka dah ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa maichâm bulah Israel pung khâwm zawng zawng hmuhah chuan a ding a, a bân a phar a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />(Solomona chu dâr dawhkân a sei lam tawng nga, a zau lam tawng nga, a sân lam tawng thuma siam biak in kawtlai taka a hûnah chuan a chuang a, Israel pung khâwmho zawng zawng hmaah chuan a ṭhingṭhi a, vân lam hawiin a bân a phar a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, lei leh vânah nangmah ang rêng Pathian an awm lo, an thinlung zawng zawnga i kawng zawhtu i chhiahhlawhte chungah chuan thuthlung hlenin i khawngaih ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />i chhiahhlawh ka pa Davida hnêna i thutiam chu i hlen a; a ni, vawiinah hian i kâa i lo sawi tawh chu i kutin i hlawhtlintîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, i chhiahhlawh ka pa Davida hnêna, ‘I thlahte chu i awm anga awm ve tûra an awm dâna an fîmkhur phawt chuan, ka mit hmuha Israel-te lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr chu i hmai lo vang,’ tia i lo tiam tâk kha hlen ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, i chhiahhlawh Davida hnêna i thu lo sawi chu hlawhtlintîr ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, nang Pathian chu lei mihringte zîngah i chêng tak meuh dâwn em ni le? Ngai teh, vân zau takah pawh i leng lo a ni a, he ka in sakah hian i va leng lo nasa lehzual âwm êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Lalpa ka Pathian, i chhiahhlawhin a auhna che leh a ṭawngṭaina hi ngaihthlâksakin, i chhiahhlawh ṭawngṭaina leh dîlna hi rawn ngaihsak ang che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />hemi hmun lam hawia i chhiahhlawh a ṭawngṭaina chu ngaithlaa, ‘Chutah chuan ka hming chu a awm ang,’ i tihna hmun ngei in lamah hian chhûn leh zâna i mit i lên reng ṭhin theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, i chhiahhlawh leh i mi Israel-te hian hemi hmun lam hawia an ṭawngṭai hunin, an dîlnate lo ngaihthlâksak ṭhîn ang che; a ni, i chênna hmun vânan lo ngaithla la; tin, lo ngaithlain ngaidam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi tu pawhin a vêngte chungah thil tisualin, chhechhamtîr hial lo ṭûl sela, hemi ina i maichâm hmaah hian rawn chham sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />nangin vân aṭangin lo ngaithla la, che la, mi sual chu a sual mana thiam loh chantîrin, mi fel chu a fel mana thiam chantîrin i chhiahhlawhte rorêlsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I mi Israel-te hian i chunga thil an tihsual avânga hmêlmate laka an lo tlâwma, i lam an lo hawi leha, i hming an ṭana, hemi ina ṭawngṭaia thil an rawn dîl che chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nangin vân aṭangin lo ngaihthlâksak la, i mi Israel-te sualna chu ngaidam la, anmahni leh an pi leh pute i pêk ramah chuan hruai leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I chunga thil an tihsual avânga vân a lo pina, ruah te a lo sûr lohva, hemi hmun lam hawia an ṭawngṭaia, i hming an ṭana, anmahni i tihhrehawm avânga an sualte an sim chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />nangin vânan lo ngaithla la, an kalna tûr kawng ṭha kawhhmuhin i chhiahhlawhte leh i mi Israel-te sualna hi ngaidamin, i mite an rochan atân i pêk i ramah hian ruah han sûrtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kan ramah hian ṭâm te a lo tlâka, hri te a lo lêna, rona emaw, ṭawihna emaw, khaukhuap emaw, pangang emaw a lo awma, an hmêlmaten an khuate an rawn huala, hri eng pawh, natna eng pawh a lo thlen chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />an hri vei emaw, an lungngaihna emaw hria apiangin, he in lam hawia bân phara, i mi Israel-te zînga tu pawhin ṭawngṭaina leh dîlna an rawn thlen chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />i awmna vânan lo ngaithla la, ngaidam la, mi tin an awm dân ang ṭheuh zêlin hlawhtlintîr ang che, an thinlung i hre ṭheuh si a (Nangmah chauh hi mihring fate thinlung hretu i ni si a);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />kan pi leh pute i pêk rama an awm chhûng zawnga i kawng zawh theihna tûra an ṭihna tûr chein.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, i mi Israel-te ni lo, hnam dang mi, i hming ropui tak leh i kut chak tak leh i bân phar avânga ram hla tak ata lo kala, hemi in lam hawia an rawn ṭawngṭai hunin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />nangin i awmna vânan lo ngaithla la, hnam dangte pawh an koh dân che ang zêlin an chungah ti ang che; tichuan, i mi Israel-te ang bawkin khawvêla hnam tinin i hming an hria ang a, an ṭih ang chia, he in ka sak hian i hming a pu tih an hre dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />I miten an hmêlmate chu i tirhna lam apianga an beihin, i khawpui thlan leh i hming tâna in ka lo sak lam hawia i hnêna an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />nangin an ṭawngṭaina leh an dîlna chu vânan lo ngaithla la, an thûah chuan pui zêl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I chunga an lo suala (tu mah sual lo an awm si lo), an chunga i thinura, hmêlma kuta i pêka, ram hla takah emaw, hnai deuhvah emaw sala an hruai emaw pawha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />sala an hruaina rama an inngaihtuah chhuaha, an inchhîra, ‘Kan lo sual ta a, dik lo tak leh suahsualthlâk takin thil kan lo ti ta a ni,’ tia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />an tânna rama dîlna an rawn thlena, sala hruaituten an hruaia an tânna rama an thinlung tak leh an rilru tak taka i lam an lo hawia, an pi leh pute ram lam leh i khawpui thlan leh i hming tâna ka in sak lam hawia i hnêna an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />an ṭawngṭaina leh an dîlna chu nangin i awmna vânan lo ngaithla la, an thûah chuan pui zêl la, i chunga lo sual ta i mite chu ngaidam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, khawngaih takin i mit lo meng la, he hmuna ṭawngṭainaah hian i beng lo chhi ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, i awmna hmunah chuan chho rawh, nang leh i chakna bâwm nên; aw Lalpa Pathian, i puithiamte chu chhandamnain thuam la, i mi thianghlimte chu ṭhatnain tihlim rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, i hriak thiha hmêl chu hawi kîrtîr suh la, i chhiahhlawh Davida thil ṭha tihte chu hre reng ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Solomona a han ṭawngṭai zawh chuan vân aṭangin mei a lo chhuk a, hâlral thilhlan leh inthawinate chu a rawn kâng ral ta a; tin, Lalpa ropuinain in chu a lo khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa ropuinain Lalpa in chu a tihkhah avângin Lalpa inah chuan puithiamte chu an lût thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte zawng zawng chuan vân aṭanga mei lo chhuk leh in chunga Lalpa ropuina chu an en reng a, lungrem chungah chuan hmaia lei siin an bawkkhup a, “Ani chu a ṭha si a, a ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn a ni,” tiin chibai an bûk a, lâwmthu an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, lal leh mipuite chuan Lalpa hmaah inthawinate an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan inthawina bâwngpa sînghnih leh sânghnih leh, berâm nuai khat leh sînghnih a hlân a. Chutiang chuan lal leh mipuite chuan Pathian in chu an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte chu an hmun ṭheuhvah an ding a; tin, Levi-hote pawh chu Lalpa hnêna lâwmthu sawi nâna phuah, “A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn a ni,” tia Lalpa fak nâna Davidan a hman ṭhin, thil ri thei nêna Lalpa hla sain an ding bawk a; tin, puithiamte chuan tawtawrâwt an hâm a, Israel mi zawng zawng chu an ding ṭhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Lalpa in hma zâwna hung chhûng kawtlai tak chu a tithianghlim bawk a; chutah chuan hâlral thilhlan te, remna thilhlan thaute a hlân a; Solomona dâr maichâm siam chu hâlral thilhlan te, chhangphut thilhlan te, thau te hlan nân a têt luattuk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi ṭum chuan Solomona leh Israel mi zawng zawng, mipui pung khâwm nasa tak chu Hamath khaw luhna aṭanga Aigupta ram lui thlenga mite nên ni sarih an kût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ni riat ni chuan inkhâwmna ropui tak an nei a; maichâm lawmna atân ni sarih an awh a; kût ni atân ni sarih an awh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, thla sarihna, ni sawmhnih leh ni thum ni chuan mipuite chu a ṭîntîr a, Lalpan Davida leh Solomona leh a mi Israel-te chunga a ṭhatna a lantîr avâng chuan, hlim tak leh lâwm takin mite chu an in lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Solomona chuan Lalpa in leh lal in chu a puitlin ta a; Solomona chuan a rilrua a tum ang takin Lalpa in leh ama in chu tluang takin a puitlin ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, zânah Solomona hnênah Lalpa a rawn inlâr a, a hnênah, “I ṭawngṭaina chu ka lo hria a, he hmun hi ka tâna inthawina inah ka ruat tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vân te ka khara, ruah te a sûr loh emaw, khaukhuapte ka tirha, ram te a tihchhiat emaw, ka mite zînga hri ka lêntîr emaw pawhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka hming pu ka mite chuan inngaitlâwma an ṭawngṭaia, mi zawna, an awm dân sualte an hawisan chuan, vân aṭangin ka lo ngaithla ang a, an sualte ka ngaidam ang a, an ram chu ka tidam leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />He hmuna ṭawngṭainaah hian ka mit ka lên ang a, ka beng ka chhi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutah chuan ka hming kumkhuaa a awm theih nân he in hi ka ruat a, ka tithianghlim tawh a ni; chutah chuan ka mit leh ka thinlung a awm kumkhua tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, nanga chungchâng thûah pawh, i pa Davida anga ka mit hmuha i awma, thu ka pêk ang zêl chea i awma, ka thuruatte leh ka rorêlte i pawm chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Israel-te zîngah rorêltu i hmai lo vang,’ tia i pa Davida hnêna thu ka thlun ang khân, i ram lalṭhutthlêng ka tinghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, in hmaa ka zam, ka dânte leh ka thupêkte in hawisana, pathian dangte rawng in bâwla, in biak chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />anmahni ka pêk ram ata hi ka tiboral hlauh ang a; tin, he in, ka hming tâna ka tihthianghlim tawh sa hi ka mit hmuh phâk lohvah ka sawn bo daih ang a, hnam tin zînga tihelna leh a chhe lama tehkhinnaah ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tin, he in sâng tak hi a kianga kal apiangin mak an ti ang a, ‘Engati nge he ram leh he in hi Lalpan hetianga a tih?’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ‘ Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian, Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu chu an hawisana, pathian dangte an vawna, an biaka, an rawng te an bâwl tâk avângin hêng chhiatna zawng zawng hi an chungah a thlentîr a nih hi,’ an la ti ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Solomonan Lalpa in leh ama in a sak chhûng kum sawmhnih a lo vei chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huraman Solomona khua a pêkte chu Solomona chuan a din a, Israela thlahte a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Hamath-zoba a bei a, a hneh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, thlalêrah Tadmor a din a, Hamath-a bungraw dahna khuate nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Beth-horon chhakta zâwk leh thlangta zâwk pawh, kulhte, kawngkhârte, a kalhnate neiin a din bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tin, Baalath khua te, a bungraw dahna khua zawng zawng te, a tawlailîr dahna khua te, a sakawr chung chuang mite awmna khua te, Jerusalem leh Lebanon leh a ram chhûng zawng zawngah Solomona chuan a duh ang angin a din a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte ni ve lo, Hit-ho te, Amor-ho te, Periz-ho te, Hiv-ho te, Jebus-hote thlah, Israela thlahten an tihboral loh, chu rama la awmte chu Solomonan chhiahhlawh hnathawka rawih luih pâwlah a siam a, tûn thleng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israela thlahte erawh chu Solomonan a hnathawktu chhiahhlawh atân a siam ve lo va, indo mi te, a sipai hotu te, puipa te, a tawlailîr leh a sakawr chung chuang mi hotute an ni zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûngte chu mipuite ho ṭhîntu, Solomona puipa berte an ni a, zahnih leh sawmnga an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Pharaoa fanu chu Davida khawpui ata a puala in a saksakah chuan a hruai chho va, “Ka nupui chu Israel lal Davida inah chuan a awm tûr a ni lo, Lalpa bâwm lo thlenna hmun thianghlim a ni,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chuan hulhliap hma lama a siam Lalpa maichâmah chuan Mosia thupêk angin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ni tin atâna bituk tâwk ang zêlin Chawlhniah te, thla thar nîah te, kût bi nei, kum khatah vawi thum Chhang dawidim telh loh kûtah te, Chawlhkâr kûtah te, Bâwkte kûtah te hâlral thilhlante a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a pa Davida lo ruat ang khân, puithiam pâwl te leh Levi-hote chu an chanpual ṭheuhva ni tina thawh ṭûl ang zêla fak tûr te, puithiamte hmaa rawngbâwl tûr tein a ruat a; tin, kawngkhâr tinah a pâwl pâwla vêngtute a ruat bawk a; chutiang chuan Pathian mi Davida chuan a lo ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalin puithiamhote, Levi-hote thu a pêk chu eng kawngah mah, sum thûah te pawh an ngaihthah ngai hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in an din ṭan tirh aṭanga an peih thlengin Solomona lo buatsaih ang chiah a ni. Tichuan, Lalpa in chu puitlin a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chu Edom rama tuifinriat kama Ezion-geber-ah leh Eloth-ah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Hurama chuan a chhiahhlawh tuifinriata che ṭhang mite chu, lawngte nên a kaltîr a; Solomona chhiahhlawhte nên Ophir-ah an kal a, chuta mi chu rangkachak talent zali leh sawmnga an rawn hâwn a, Lal Solomona hnênah an rawn thlen a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Solomona hmingthanzia Seba lalnuin a lo hriat chuan Solomona chu thu khirh tak taka fiah tumin hnung zuitu tam tak hruaiin, sanghâwngseitea englo rimtuite leh rangkachak tam tak leh lunghlute phurin, Jerusalem-ah a han kal a; tin, Solomona hnên a han thlen chuan, a rilrua awm zawng zawng chu phawrh fai vekin a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan a thu zawh zawng zawng chu a chhâng vek a; Solomona chuan a chhân theih loh rêng rêng a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Solomona finzia te, a in sak te, a dawhkâna ei tûr te, a puipateho ṭhut dân te, a rawngbâwltuteho rawngbâwl dân te, an inchei dân te, a no hlântute leh an inchei dân te, Lalpa ina a han chhohna te Seba lalnuin a han hmuh chuan rilru ahleih a nei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal hnênah chuan, “I thiltihte leh i finzia thuthang ka rama ka lo hriat chu a dik ngei a lo nih hi le;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nimahsela, keima mit ngeia ka rawn hmuh hma loh chuan an sawi mai chu ka âwih ṭhîn lo va, ngai teh, i finna ropuizia zâtve pawh mi lo hrilh hlei nêm le; i hmingthan ka lo hriat dân chu i khûm daih mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I mite chu an va nihlawhin, hêng i chhiahhlawh i bula awm fova, i finna thu ngaithla fo ṭhînte hi an va nihlawh êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian, i chunga lâwm, a lal atâna a lalṭhutthlênga ṭhuttîrtu che Lalpa i Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se; i Pathianin Israel-ho hi kumkhuaa tihngheh atân a hmangaih a; chuvângin, fel taka rorêl tûrin an lalah a siam che a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chu rangkachak talent za leh sawmhnih leh englo rimtui tam tak mai leh lunghlute a pe a, Seba lalnuin Lal Solomona englo rimtui a pêk ang rêng rêng hi a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chhiahhlawhte leh Hurama chhiahhlawhte, Ophir aṭanga rangkachak va phurte pawh chuan algum thing leh lunghlute an rawn phur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan algum thing chu Lalpa in leh lal in hung nân leh hla satute tâna ṭingṭang leh perhkhuangah a siam a; chutiang chu Judai ramah tûn hma lam chuan an la hmu ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Seba lalnu hnênah chuan a duh apiang, lal hnêna a rawn ken aia tam zâwk fe chu Lal Solomona chuan a pe bawk a. Chutichuan, a ram lamah a hote nên an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi inawmpawlhho leh sumdâwnghote rawn lâk luh tiam hauh lovin, Solomona hnêna kum khat chhûnga rangkachak lo lût rih lam chu rangkachak talent zaruk leh sawmruk leh paruk bûk a ni; tin, Arabia lal zawng zawng leh ram awptute chuan Solomona hnênah rangkachak te, tangkarua te an rawn la ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomona chuan rangkachak den phêkin phaw lian mi zahnih a siam a: phaw lian pakhatin rangkachak sekel zaruk a duh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak den phêkin phaw zathum a siam a; phaw pakhatin rangkachak sekel zathum a duh a; chûng chu Lebanon ngawpui inah chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan saingho lalṭhutthlêng ropui tak a siam bawk a, rangkachak hlîr hlakin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêngah chuan a kai chhohna rahka paruk te, lalṭhutthlêng nêna zawm, rangkachak ke nghahchhan te, ṭhutthlêng sîr tuaka bân nghahna te, a bân nghahna bula ding sakeibaknei lem pahnih te a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, rahka paruk sîr tuak chungah chuan sakeibaknei sâwm leh pahnih a ding a; chutiang chu khawii ramah mah an siam ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lal Solomona no zawng zawng chu rangkachak vek a ni a; tin, Lebanon ngawpui ina bungbêl zawng zawng pawh rangkachak hlîr hlak vek a ni a; Solomona dam lai chuan tangkarua chu engah mah an ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal chuan lawng rual, Hurama chhiahhlawhte Tarsis-a kal ṭhîn kawppui a nei a, kum thum dan zêlah Tarsis lawng rual chuan rangkachak te, tangkarua te, saingho te, zâwng te, ârâwn te a rawn phur ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Solomona chuan khawvêl lal zawng zawng chu hausakah leh finah a khûm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathianin a thinlunga a dah, a finna thu chu ngaithla tûrin khawvêl lal zawng zawng chuan Solomona chu an pan huai huai ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, kum tin pêk bi neiin tangkaraw bungbêl te, rangkachak bungbêl te, puan te, râlthuam te, englo rimtui te, sakawr te, sabengtungte an rawn pe ṭheuh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan sakawr leh tawlailîr dahna hmun sângli a nei a; tin, sakawr chung chuang mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih a nei a, chûngte chu tawlailîr dahna khuaah te, Jerusalem-a lal hnênahte a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Lui aṭanga Philistia ram leh Aigupta ram thlenga lal zawng zawng chungah a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Jerusalem khuaah chuan a tam êm avângin tangkaruate chu lung ang maia ngaih khawpin a awmtîr a, sidar thingte chu phaia theipui thing ang leka ngaih khawpin a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Solomona tân sakawrte Aigupta aṭangte leh ram tin aṭangtein an rawn la ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Solomona chanchin dangte chu a bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin zâwlnei Nathana ziak chanchin buah te, Silo mi Ahija hrilh lâwkna buah te, Nebata fapa Jeroboama chungchâng thûa zâwlnei Idova inlârna buah te a chuang lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chu Jerusalem-ah Israel mi zawng zawng chungah kum sawmli a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, a pa Davida khuaah an phûm a, a aiah a fapa Rehoboama a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chu Sekem khuaah a kal a; Israel-ho zawng zawng chu Sekem khuaah lala siam tûrin an kal tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Nebata fapa Jeroboaman chumi thu chu a lo hriat chuan (Lal Solomona hnên ata tlân bova, Aigupta rama la awm a ni si a) Aigupta ram ata Jeroboama chu a lo haw leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi an tîr a, an zu ko va; tichuan, Jeroboama leh Israel-ho zawng zawng chu an lo kal a, Rehoboama hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“I pa khân kan nghâwngkawl a tirit êm ṭhîn a; chuvângin, i pain min chhawr rimna leh a nghâwngkawl rit tak kan chunga a nghah hi min tihzânsak la; tichuan, i rawng kan bâwl ang,” tiin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ni thum hnuah lo kal leh zâwk rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, mipuite chu an kal kiang ta rih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lal Rehoboama chuan, “Heng mipuite chhânna tûr hian rem eng nge mi ruatpui dâwn le?” tiin, a pa Solomona dam laia a bula awm ṭhîn upahote chu a râwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Hêng mipuite hi i khawngaiha, i tihlâwma, an hnêna thu ṭha tak takte i sawi chuan kumkhuain i mite an ni ang,” tiin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, upaho remruatpui chu a pawm lo va, ama rualpui tlangvâlho, a bula awm ṭhînte chu a râwn ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Hêng mipuiho, ka hnêna, ‘I pan kan chunga nghâwngkawl a nghah hi min tihzânsak rawh,’ tia sawitute hi ka chhân dân tûr rem eng nge mi ruatpui le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a rualpui tlangvâlhote chuan a hnênah, “Hêng mipuiho, ‘I pa khân kan nghâwngkawl a tirit êm ṭhîn a, nang chuan min tihzânsak rawh khai,’ i hnêna titute hnênah chuan hetiang hian ti la, hetiang hian an hnênah sawi ang che, ‘Ka pa kâwng ai chuan ka zungtê hi a lian zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pa khân nghâwngkawl rit tak a lo bahtîr che u a, kei chuan in nghâwngkawl chu ka belhchhah dâwn asin; ka pa’n vuaknain a hrîng ṭhîn che u a, kei erawh chuan khawmualkaikuangin ka hrîng dâwn che u a ni,’ tiin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jeroboama leh mipuiho zawng zawng chu lalin, “Ni thum chinah lo kal leh ang che u,” tia a hrilh ang khân a ni thum ni chuan Rehoboama hnênah chuan an va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal chuan chang takin a lo chhâng hlawm a, Lal Rehoboama chuan upahote remruatpui kha a pawm lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tlangvâlhote remruatpui ang khân, “Ka pan in nghâwngkawl a lo tirit a, keiin chu chu ka belhchhah zâwk dâwn a ni; ka pan vuaknain a lo hrîng ṭhîn che u a, kei erawh chuan khawmualkaikuangin ka hrîng dâwn che u a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan mipuite thusawi kha a pawm ta lo va; chu chu Pathian vâng a ni, Lalpan Silo mi Ahija hmanga Nebata fapa Jeroboama hnêna a thu lo sawi tawh kha a tihngheh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, lalin an thu a pawm lo tih Israel-ho zawng zawngten an hriatin mipuite chuan, “Davida-ah chuan chanvo eng nge kan neih le? Jesaia fapaah chuan roluah tûr kan nei hek lo. Aw Israel mite u, in puan in lamah haw ṭheuh rawh u! Aw David, i chhûngkua ngaihtuah mai rawh,” tiin lal chu an chhâng a. Chutichuan, Israel-ho zawng zawng chu an puan in lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israela thlah, Judai ram khuaa awmte erawh chu an chungah Rehoboama a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Lal Rehoboama chuan hnathawka rawih luihte hotu Hadorama a tîr a; ani chu Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan lungin an lo dêng a, a thi ta a. Tin, Lal Rehoboama chu Jerusalem khuaa tlân tumin a tawlailîrah a chuang ta thuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-hote chu Davida chhûngte chungah an lo hel ta a ni, tûn thleng hian.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chuan Jerusalem a han thlen chuan, Israel-hote dova, Rehoboama ram la leh tûrin Juda leh Benjamina chhûngte, mi huaisen ṭhiau thlan chhuah, nuai khat leh sîngriat zet a khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian mi Semaia hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Judai ram lal Solomona fapa Rehoboama hnênah leh Judai ram leh Benjamin rama Israel mi zawng zawng hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti, ‘In han kal tûr a ni lo va, in unaute chu han do hek suh u! Mahni in lamah haw leh vek rawh u; hei hi keima tih a ni e,’ tiin sawi rawh,” tiin. Chutichuan, Lalpa thu chu an awih a, Jeroboama do tûra an kal tûr chu an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chu Jerusalem khuaah a awm a, Judai ramah invên nân khuate a siam a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem khua te, Etam te, Tekoa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Beth-zur te, Soko te, Adulam te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gath te, Maresa te, Ziph te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adoraim te, Lakis te, Azeka te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zora te, Aijalon te, Hebron khua te; chûng chu Judai leh Benjamin rama kulh nei khuate a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chûng kulhte chu a tinghet a, hotute a dah a, ei tûr te, hriak te, uain te a chhêk khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, khaw tinah chuan phaw te, fei te a dah a, khaw nghet takah a siam hlawm a. Tin, Judai leh Benjamin ram chu a ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Israel ram zawng zawnga puithiamte leh Levi-hote chu an ram aṭang ṭheuhvin a hnênah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi-hote chuan an ram leh an awmnate an chhuahsan a, Judai ram leh Jerusalem-ah an kal a; Jeroboama leh a fapaten Lalpa tâna puithiam hna thawk lo tûrin an bântîr si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a hmun sâng atân leh kêlpa leh bâwngno lem a siam atâna puithiamte a ruat tâk zâwk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Israel hnam, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian lama rilru thle zawng zawngte chuan an zui a, Lalpa an pi leh pute Pathian hnêna inthawi tûrin Jerusalem-ah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Judai ram chu an tinghet a; kum thum chhûng chu Solomona fapa Rehoboama chu an tinghet a; kum thum chhûng chu Davida leh Solomona kawng chu an zawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chuan Davida fapa Jerimotha fanu Mahalathi nupuiah a nei a, chu chu Jesaia fapa Eliaba fanu Abihaili fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Fapate a hrinsak a: Jeusa te, Semaria te, Zahama te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani hnuah chuan Absaloma fanu Maaki a nei a; ani chuan Abija te, Ataia te, Ziza te, Selomitha te a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chuan Absaloma fanu Maaki chu a nupuite leh a hmeite zawng zawngah chuan a hmangaih bîk a (nupui sâwm leh pariat leh hmei sawmruk a nei a, fapa sawmhnih leh pariat leh fanu sawmruk a nei a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chuan Maaki fapa Abija chu a unaute zînga chungnung berah a dah a; lala siam a rilrûk nghe nghe a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Fing takin rem a ruat a, a fapate zawng zawng chu Judai ram leh Benjamin ram zawng zawnga kulh nei khuaahte a awm darhtîr vek a; ei tûr tam tak a pe a, nupui tam tak a zawnsak hlawm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chu a lo lal ngheh tâk chinah chuan, a lama ṭang Israel-ho zawng zawng nên Lalpa dân chu an hawisan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Lal Rehoboama kum nga a lal kum chuan Lalpa chunga an sual avângin Aigupta lal Sisaka chuan tawlailîr sângkhat leh zahnih leh sakawr chung chuang mi sîngruk nên Jerusalem a han bei a. Aigupta rama mi a hnêna kalte chu chhiar sên rual an ni lo: Lub-ho te, Sukki-ho te, Ethiopia-ho te an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judai rama kulh nei khuate a la a, Jerusalem a va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Semaia chu Rehoboama leh Juda-ho puipa, Sisaka avânga Jerusalem-a pung khâwmho hnênah chuan a han kal a, an hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, ‘Mi hawisan ta a; chuvângin, kei pawhin Sisaka kutah ka dah ta che u a ni,’ tiin,” a han ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-ho puipate leh lal chu an intihnuai a, “ Lalpa chu a fel a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan an intihhnuai chu a lo hriat chuan Lalpa thu Semaia hnênah a lo thleng a, “An intihnuai ta a; ka tiboral vek lo vang a, ṭhenkhat ka chhan him ang a, Sisaka hmangin Jerusalem chungah ka thinurna ka leih lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a chhiahhlawhte an ni ang, ka rawngbâwl leh ram dang mi rawngbâwl dân an hriat nân,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Aigupta lal Sisaka chu Jerusalem beiin a han chho va, Lalpa ina rote leh lal ina rote a la a; a la zo vek a ni. Solomona siam rangkachak phawte pawh a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lal Rehoboama chuan chûng aiah chuan dâr phawte a siam a, lal in kawngkhâr vêngtu sipai hotute a kawltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, lal chu Lalpa ina a luh apiangin vêngtute chuan an keng a; tin, vêngtute pindanah chuan an dah leh zêl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a han intihhnuai tâk avâng chuan a tihboral hlauh loh nân a chunga Lalpa thinurna chu a kiang ta a; tin, Judai ram chu a la ṭha reng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Rehoboama chu Jerusalem-ah chuan a intinghet a, ro a rêl a: Rehoboama chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmli leh kum khat a ni a, Lalpan a hming awmtîrna tûra Israel hnam zawng zawng zînga a thlan khua Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum sarih a lal a; a nu hming chu Naami, Amon mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa zawn nân a rilru a hman loh avângin thil ṭha lo a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Rehoboama chanchin chu a bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin zâwlnei Semaia ziak chanchin buah leh zâwlnei Idova ziak chanchin bua thlahte chanchin zîngah ziak a ni lâwm ni? Rehoboama leh Jeroboama chu an indo reng mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, Davida khuaah an phûm a. Tichuan, a aiah a fapa Abija a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeroboama kum sâwm leh kum riat a lal kumin Juda-ho chungah Abija a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah kum thum a lal a; a nu hming chu Maaki, Gibea mi Uriela fanu a ni. Tin, Abija leh Jeroboama chu an indo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Abija chuan sipai indo mi, mi huaisen nuai li thlan ṭhiau nên an va bei a; tin, Jeroboama chuan mi chak huaisen thlan ṭhiau nuai riat inzârin a lo do va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Abija chu Ephraim tlâng rama Zemaraim tlângah a ding a, “Aw Jeroboam, Israel-ho zawng zawng nên lo ngaithla rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan Israel ram chu Davida leh a fate hnênah chi thuthlungin kumkhua atân a pe tih hre âwm tak in ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, Nebata fapa Jeroboama, Davida fapa Solomona chhiahhlawh chu a pu chungah a lo hel ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama a la naupana, a rilru a la nêma, a lo dodâl theih loh lai khân Solomona fapa Rehoboama kalhin mi bengtla loho, Beliala fate an pung khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Davida fapate lakah hian Lalpa ram chu do theih in inring a; tam pawh in tam hle a, Jeroboaman pathian atâna a siamsak che u rangkachak bâwngno lemte pawh in hnênah a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa puithiam, Arona fapate leh Levi-hote chu hnawt chhuakin, ram dang mite tih dân angin puithiam in insiam a ni lâwm ni? Tichuan, bâwngtuai leh berâm pasariha rawn inhlân apiangte chu pathian ni lawi lo puithiam an ni thei zêl mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, keini zawng, Lalpa chu kan Pathian a ni a, amah chu kan hawisan lo va; Lalpa tâna rawngbâwltu mahni hna ṭheuh thawk Arona fapa puithiamte leh Levi-hote kan nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ni tin leh zan tin Lalpa tân hâlral thilhlan te, rimtui te an hâl ṭhîn a; chhang chhiah pawh dawhkân thianghlimah an dah fel diam ṭhîn a, tlai lam apianga hâl tûrin rangkachak khâwnvâr dahna a khâwnvârte nên; keini zawngin Lalpa kan Pathian thupêk chu kan zâwm reng a, nangni erawh chuan amah chu in hawisan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, Pathian chu kan hma hruaiin kan hnênah a awm a; tin, a puithiamte an tawtawrâwta nangmahni hnawt tûra hâm tûrin an awm bawk a. Aw, Israela thlahte u, Lalpa , in pi leh pute Pathian chu do lul suh u, in hmuingîl tawp hlei lo vang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jeroboama chuan an hnung lamah a chân rûktîr a; tichuan, Juda-te hma lamah an awm a, châng rutute chu an hnung lamah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chu an han lehhawi chuan râl chu an hnung lam leh an hma lamah an lo awm a, Lalpa chu an au ta a, puithiamte chuan tawtawrâwt an hâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda-te chu an au ta dur dur a; chutia Juda-te an au dur dur chuan heti hi a ni a, Abija leh Juda-ho hmaah chuan Lalpan Jeroboama leh Israel-ho zawng zawng chu a titlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte chu Juda-ho hmaah chuan an tlânchhia a, Pathianin an kutah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abija leh a hote chuan an that ta chiam mai a; tichuan, Israel mi thlan ṭhiau nuai nga an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi ṭuma Israela thlahte tlâwm dân chu chutiang chu a ni, Juda thlahte chuan Lalpa an pi leh pute Pathian an rin avângin an ngam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Abija chuan Jeroboama chu a ûm a, hêng khuate hi a lâksak a: Bethel leh a khawperte, Jesana a khawperte nên, Ephron a khawperte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abija lal chhûng chuan Jeroboaman din chhuah lehna a nei ta lo; Lalpan a hrem a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abija erawh chu a lo chak ta deuh deuh va, nupui sâwm leh pali a nei a, fapa sawmhnih leh pahnih leh fanu sâwm leh paruk a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abija chanchin dangte leh a awm dân te, a thusawite chu zâwlnei Idova hrilhfiahna buah a chuang a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abija chu a pute hnênah a muhîl a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a, a aiah a fapa Asa a lal ta a; a lal chhûng chuan an ram chu kum sâwm zet râlmuangin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa chuan Lalpa a Pathian mit hmuhah thil ṭha leh thil dik a ti ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ram dang pathian maichâmte leh hmun sângte a thehthang bo va, lungphunte a tichim a, Aseri-te a kit a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda-hote chu Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian zawng tûr leh a dân leh a thupêk zâwm tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te khua zawng zawnga hmun sângte leh rimtui hâlna maichâmte chu a thehthang bo vek bawk a; a hnuaiah ram chu râlmuangin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Judai ramah chuan kulh nei khuate a siam a; ram chu râlmuangin a awm a, Lalpan râlmuanna a pêk avângin chûng kum chuan tu mah do a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda-te hnênah chuan, “Hêng khuate hi i din ṭha ang u khai, kulhtein hung ila, in sâng te, kulh kawngkhâr te, a kalhna te i siam ang u; Lalpa kan Pathian hi kan zawn tâk avângin ram chu kan hnuaiah a lo awm ta a; amah chu kan zawng a, ani chuan kil tin kil tangah râlmuangin min awmtîr ta a ni,” a ti a. Chutichuan, an din ṭha a, an hmuingîl ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Asa chuan Juda mi, phaw leh fei keng mi sipai nuai thum a nei a; tin, Benjamin mi, phaw leh thal hmang mi nuai hnih leh sîngriat; chûng zawng zawng chu mi chak huaisen vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Ethiopia mi Zera, sipai maktaduai leh tawlailîr zathum nên anmahni bei tûrin a lo thawk a; Maresa a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Asa chu a bei tûrin a va thawk a, Maresa-ah Zephatha ruamah an va inzâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Asa chuan Lalpa a Pathian a au va, “ Lalpa chauh lo chu mi chak tak laka chak lo ṭanpuitu an awm lo va; aw Lalpa kan Pathian, min ṭanpui rawh khai; nangmah ringin i hmingin hêng mipuiho hi kan rawn bei a ni a. Aw Lalpa , kan Pathian i ni a, mihringin nang chu ngam suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan Asa leh Juda-te hmaah chuan Ethiopia mite chu a bei a; tichuan, Ethiopia mite chu an tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Asa leh a hote chuan Gerar thlengin an ûm a. Ethiopia mite chuan thi an tam êm avângin ṭan an khawh thei ta lo va, Lalpa leh a sipaite hmaah chuan tihtlâwm an ni ta a; râllâk sum tam tak an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gerar vêla khua zawng zawng chu an bei a, Lalpa chu an hlau ta a, khua zawng zawng chu an rawk a, râllâk sum a tam hle mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ranpuho puan inte pawh an bei a, berâm leh sanghâwngsei tam tak an kawi a, Jerusalem-ah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Odeda fapa Azaria chungah Pathian thlarau a lo thleng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa hmu tûrin a kal chhuak a, a hnênah, “Asa leh Juda mi zawng zawng leh Benjamin mite u, ka thu ngaithla teh u. A lama in ṭan chhûng zawng Lalpa chu in lamah a ṭang a, amah in zawn chuan in hmu ang a, amah in hawisan chuan ani pawhin a hawisan ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite chu rei tak Pathian tak nei lo leh zirtîrtu leh puithiam nei lo leh dân nei lovin an lo awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />amaherawhchu, an mangana, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian lam an hawia, an zawn veleh an hmu a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai chuan a chhuak lam leh a lût lamte tân râlmuanga awmna a awm lo va, ram chhûnga awm zawng zawngte tân manganna nasa tak hlîr a ni zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnam leh hnam, khua leh khua an intichhe rem rum a; Pathianin hrehawm tinrêngin a timangang a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni zawng chak takin awm ula, inthlahdah suh u, in thiltih man chu in hmu dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Asan chûng thûte leh zâwlnei Odeda thusawite chu a hriatin a intihuai a, Judai ram leh Benjamin ram zawng zawng ata leh Ephraim tlâng rama a khaw lâk ata thil tenawmte chu a thehthang bo vek a; Lalpa hulhliap bula Lalpa maichâm chu a din ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Judai ram leh Benjamin rama mi zawng zawng, a hnêna khawsa ve Ephraim leh Manase leh Simeon rama mite nên a ko khâwm vek a; Lalpa a Pathian a hnênah a awm tih an hriatin Israel ram aṭangin an rawn bêl ta huai huai mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Asa kum sâwm leh kum nga a lal kum, a thla thumnaah Jerusalem-ah an pung khâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan an râllâk bâwngpa zasarih leh berâm sângsarihin Lalpa hnênah an inthawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an rilru leh an thinlung zawng zawngin Lalpa an pi leh pute Pathian zawng tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tu pawh Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian zawng lo chu a lian a tê, a hmei a pain tihhlum tûr thu an thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa hnênah aw ring takin, au râwlin, tawtawrâwt ri nên, tawtawrâwt bi nei ri nên chhia an chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Juda mi zawng zawng chu lungsi taka chhechham an nih avângin an lâwm tlâng hle a, Lalpa chu tihtak zetin an zawng a, hmuh pawh an hmu ta rêng a, hmun tinah râlmuangin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lal Asa nu Maaki pawh chu milem tenawm tak Aseri a siamsak avângin a lal nu nihna a bân a; tin, Asa chuan a milem chu a sât thlu a, a tisawm dep a, Kidron luiah a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Israel ram ata hmun sângte chu thehthang bo a ni lo va; nimahsela, Asa rilru chu a lal chhûng chuan a fel hle reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a pan thil a lo hlan leh ama lo hlan tangkarua te, rangkachak te, bungbêlte chu Pathian inah a la lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Asa lal lai kum sawmthum leh kum nga chhûng chuan indo rêng rêng a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asa kum sawmthum leh kum ruk a lal kumin Israel lal Baasa chuan Juda-te a han bei a, Juda lal Asa hnêna lût tûr leh chhuak tûr dan nân Rama khua a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Asan Lalpa in leh lal ina ro tangkarua leh rangkachakte chu a la chhuak a, Damaska-a Suria lal Ben-hadada hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pa leh i pa kârah thuthlung a awm a, ngai teh, tangkarua leh rangkachakte ka thawn a che; ti teh, Israel lal Baasa hian mi ṭînsanna tûrin a hnêna i thuthlun kha ṭhiat leh teh mai,” tiin a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Ben-hadada chuan Lal Asa thu chu a lo pawm a; tichuan, Israel khuate chu bei tûrin sipai hotute a tîr a; Ijon khua te, Dan khua te, Abel-maim khua te, Naphtali rama bungraw dahna khua zawng zawngte an bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Baasan chumi thu chu a lo hriat veleh Rama khua a siam lai chu a chawlhsan a, a thiltih tum chu a ṭhulh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Asa chuan Juda mi zawng zawng chu a hruai a, Baasan Rama khaw siam nâna lung leh thing a hmante chu an la vek a, chu chuan Geba leh Mizpa khua a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai chuan zâwlnei Hanania chu Juda lal Asa hnênah a lo kal a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa i Pathian ring lovin Suria lal i ring a; chuvângin, Suria lal sipai rualte chu i chhuah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethiopia-ho leh Lub-hote chu sipai rual lian tak, tawlailîr leh sakawr chung chuang mite tam tak an ni lâwm ni kha? Nimahsela, Lalpa i rin avâng khân i kutah a pe a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lama rilru dik tak putute chunga a chakzia tilang tûrin khawvêl zawng zawngah Lalpa mit chu a lêng ruai ruai ṭhîn a ni. Atthlâk takin thil i ti a nih hi; tûn achinah chuan do i nei reng tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Asa chu zâwlnei chungah chuan a thinrim a, tân inah a khung ta a; a thusawi avângin a thinrim ta hle mai a ni. Tin, Asa chuan mi ṭhenkhat pawh a tiduhdah leh ta nghâl zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, Asa chanchin chu a bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin Juda leh Israel lalte chanchin ziakna buah a chuang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, kum sawmthum leh kum kua a lal kumin Asa chu a ke a lo na ta a, a nâ chu nasa tak a ni; nimahsela, a natnaah chuan Lalpa râwn lovin damdawi thiamte a râwn zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Asa chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, kum sawmli leh kum khat a lal kumin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida khawpuia ama puala a ker, ama thlânah an phûm a, rimtui tui tak, rimtui siamtuten rimtui chi hrang hrang an siama khat khumah an zalh a, a pualah meipui nasa tak an chhep a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, a fapa Jehosaphata a aiah a lal a, Israel mite do tûrin a indin nghet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Judai rama kulh nei khua zawng zawngah sipaite a dah a, Judai ram leh a pa Asan a lo lâk Ephraim rama khuaahte chuan râlvêngtute a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata hnênah chuan Lalpa a awm a; Baala te zawng lovin a pu Davidan a zawh hmasak tawh kawng chu a zawh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an pi leh pute Pathian chu zawnga, Israel mite tih ang ti lova a thupêkte a zawm zâwk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpan a ram chu a kutah a tinghet a; tichuan, Judai rama mi zawng zawngin Jehosaphata chu lâwmman te an rawn pe a, a lo hausain a lo ropui ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a rilru chu Lalpa lamah a thle a; tin, Judai ram ata hmun sângte leh Aseri-te a thehthang bo vek bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, kum thum a lal kumin a mi lian Ben-haila te, Obadia te, Zekaria te Nethanela te, Mikaia te chu Judai ram khuatea mite zirtîr tûrin a tîr chhuak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Levi mi, Semaia te, Nethania te, Zebadia te, Asahela te, Semiramotha te, Jehonathana te, Adonija te, Tobija te, Tob-adonija te an tel ve a; tin, puithiam Elisama leh Jehorama an tel bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa dân bu an keng a, Judai ramah chuan an zirtîr a, Judai ram khua zawng zawng an fang a, mite an zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Judai ram vêl ram zawng zawnga mite chuan Lalpa chu an hlau va, tu mân Jehosaphata chu an do ngam lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mi ṭhenkhatin Jehosaphata chu lâwmman an rawn pe a, chhiah atân tangkarua te an pe bawk a; tin, Arabia mite pawhin ran rual, berâmpa sângsarih leh zasarih leh kêlpa sângsarih leh zasarih an rawn pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehosaphata chu a lo ropui ta hle mai a, Judai ramah kulhte leh thil dah khâwmna khuate a siam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judai ram khuaahte chuan hna tam tak a nei a; tin, Jerusalem-ah sipai mi chak huaisente a ngah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, an chhûngkua kua zêla an awm dân chu hetiang hi a ni - Juda chhûngkuaa sâng hotute chu, hotu Adna chuan mi chak huaisen nuai thum a ho va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a dawttu Jehohananan nuai hnih leh sîngriat a ho va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, a dawt lehtu Zikria fapa Amasia chu inphal taka Lalpa tâna inpein, mi chak huaisen nuai hnih a ho va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tin, Benjamin chhûngkuate - mi chak huaisen Eliadan thal leh phaw hmang mi nuai hnih a ho va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a dawttu Jehozabada chuan râl kâp tûra inpeih diam nuai khat leh sîngriat a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hi Judai rama kulh nei khuaa lalin a dahte tiam lova lal hnêna awm rengte an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehosaphata chu a lo hausain a lo ropui ta hle mai a; tin, Ahaba nêna inkûngkaihna a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, kum eng emaw zât hnu chuan Samari-ah Ahaba hnênah a zuk kal a; tin, Ahaba chuan amah leh a hote chu berâm leh bâwngpa tam tak a lo talh a, Ramoth-gilead khuaa han chhohpuiah a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal Ahaba chuan Juda lal Jehosaphata hnênah chuan, “Ramoth-gilead khuaah kan han chho dûn dâwn lâwm ni?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Kei leh nang, ka mite leh i mite chu pumkhat kan ni alâwm, râl chu kan bei za ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chuan Israel lal hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa thu ngaichâng rih phawt la maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel lal chuan zâwlneiho mi zali a ko khâwm a, an hnênah, “Ramoth-gilead khua bei tûrin kan han thawk ang nge thawk lo vang?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Han thawk rawh khai, Pathianin lal kutah a pe dâwn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jehosaphata chuan, “ Lalpa zâwlnei tu emaw kan han râwn tûr an awm lâwm ni aw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan Jehosaphata hnênah, “ Lalpa min râwnsak tûr mi pakhat chu a la awm kha maw! Nimahsela, ani zawng ka huat zâwng tak a ni; ka chungchâng thu hi a chhe lam ngawt lo chu a ṭha lam rêng rêng a sawi ngai si lo va; chu mi chu Imla fapa Mikaia a ni,” a ti a. Tin, Jehosaphata chuan, “Lal chuan chutiang chuan ti teh suh se â,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel lal chuan hotu pakhat a han ko va, “Imla fapa Mikaia han hruai thuai teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal leh Juda lal Jehosaphata chu Samari kulh kawngka luhna bul hmun thâwl laiah an lal puana inthuamin an lalṭhutthlêng ve veah an ṭhu a; tin, zâwlnei zawng zawng chuan an hmaah thu an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Kenaana fapa Zedekian thîr kîte a siam a, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti, ‘Hêngte hian Suria-hote chu boral dêr khawpin i si ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chutiang bawkin zâwlnei dangte pawh chuan, “Ramoth-gilead-ah chuan han chho la, han hmuingîl rawh khai; Lalpan lal kutah hian a pe dâwn a ni,” tiin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia ko tûra an tirha chuan, “Ngai teh khai, zâwlneite chuan thukhat vuain a ṭha lamin lal hnênah thu an sawi ṭheuh va; chuvângin, nang pawhin an sawi tâk angin a ṭha lamin han sawi ve teh khai,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia chuan, “ Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka Pathianin a sawi ang chiahin a ni ka sawi dâwn ni,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, lal hnên a han thlen chuan lalin a hnênah, “Mikai, Ramoth-gilead khua bei tûrin kan han thawk ang nge thawk lo vang?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Han thawk ula, han hmuingîl rawh u, i kutah pêk a ni dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Thutak ngawt lo chu ka hnênah Lalpa hminga sawi lo tûrin vawi eng zât nge maw chhia ka chhamtîr dâwn che le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Berâm, vêngtu nei lo angin Israel-ho zawng zawngte chu tlângahte darh vekin ka hmu a; tin, Lalpan , ‘Hêngho hian hotu an nei ta lo va, mahni in lamah thlamuang takin haw dial mai rawh se,’ a ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan Jehosaphata hnênah, “Ka chungchâng thu hi a chhe lam ngawt lo chu a ṭha lam rêng rêng zawng a sawi hlei lo vang e, tih ka hrilh che a ni lâwm ni kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia chuan, “Khai le, Lalpa thu ngaithla teh u, Lalpa chu a lalṭhutthlênga ṭhua vân mipuiho zawng zawng a ding lam leh a vei lama dingin ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, ‘Israel lal Ahaba hi Ramoth-gilead-a han chhova, han thi tûrin tuin nge thlêm dâwn?’ a tih hun chuan pakhatin, ‘Chutin khatin,’ a ti a, mi dangin, ‘Chutiang khatiang chuan,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, thlarau pakhat a lo chhuak a, Lalpa hmaah a ding a, ‘Keiman ka thlêm ang e,’ a ti a. Tin, Lalpan a hnênah, ‘Engin maw?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, ‘Ka va kal ang a, a zâwlneite zawng zawng kâah chuan thlarau dawtheiah ka va chang ang,’ a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, ‘I va thlêm ngei ang a, hlawh pawh i hlawhtling bawk ang. Va kal ta la, chutiang chuan va ti rawh le,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, ngai teh, Lalpa chuan hêng i zâwlneite kâah hian thlarau dawthei a dah a; i chungchâng thu Lalpan a ṭha lo lamin a sawi ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu veleh Kenaana fapa Zedekia chuan a va hnaih a, Mikaia chu a biangah a va bêng a, “I hnêna thusawi tûrin Lalpa thlarau chuan khawii lamah nge mi chhuahsan?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia chuan, “Ngai teh, pindan chhûngrila biru tûra i luh nîah i la hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel lal chuan, “Mikaia hi hruai ula, khaw awptu Amona leh lal fapa Joasa hnênah kalpui leh rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tin, lalin heti hian a ti, ‘He mi hi lung inah khung ula, thlamuang taka ka lo haw leh hma loh chuan hrehawm chaw leh hrehawm tui lo pe rawh u, a ti,’ ti ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia chuan, “Thlamuang taka i lo haw leh chuan kei mi hmangin Lalpan thu a sawi lo a ni ang le,” a ti a. Tin, amah vêkin, “Nangni mipui zawng zawng pawhin lo hre rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal leh Juda lal Jehosaphata chu Ramoth-gilead khuaah chuan an han chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan Jehosaphata hnênah chuan, “Ka inbâwl danglam ang a, inbeihnaah chuan ka kal ve ang a; nang erawh chu i lal puan inbel rawh,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Israel lal chu a inbâwl danglam a, inbeihnaah chuan an han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Suria lal chuan a tawlailîrte chunga hotute hnênah chuan, “Israel lal ngawt lo chu mi tê pawh mi lian pawh bei suh ang che u,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, tawlailîr chunga hotute chuan Jehosaphata an han hmuh chuan, “Israel lal a nih saw maw,” an ti a. Tichuan, beih tumin an hual ta a; nimahsela, Jehosaphata chu a au va, Lalpan a pui ta a; tichuan, Pathianin a tihkîrsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, tawlailîr chunga hotuten Israel lal a ni lo tih an hriat chuan ûm lovin an kîrsan leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat hian tum bîk nei lêm lovin a thal ngul a han kuai a, Israel lal chu a âwmphaw inkârah a kâp a; tichuan, a tawlailîr khalhtu hnênah chuan, “Khalh lêt la, mipui zîng ata hi mi chhuahpui rawh khai, hliam na tak ka tuar a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan inbeihna chu a nasa hle mai a; tin, Israel lal chu Suria-hote lam hawiin a tawlailîrah tlai lam thlengin a ding a; tin, ni tlâk dâwn vêlah a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Jehosaphata chu thlamuang takin Jerusalem-a a inah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Hanania fapa Jehua chuan a lo hmuak a, Lal Jehosaphata hnênah, “Mi suaksual chu i ṭanpuiin Lalpa hawtute chu i hmangaih dâwn a ni maw? Hemi avâng hian Lalpa thinurna i chungah a lo awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, he ram ata Aseri i thehthang bova, Lalpa i zawn avâng hian ṭhatna kawng eng emaw zawng i la nei cheu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chu Jerusalem-ah a awm a; tin, Beer-seba aṭanga Ephraim tlâng ram thlengin a mite zîngah a kal leh a, Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian lamah a hruai kîr leh hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, khaw tinah Judai ram kulh nei khua zawng zawngahte chuan rorêltute a dah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />rorêltute hnênah chuan, “In thiltih chu ngun taka ngaihtuahin ti rawh u; mihring tâna rorêl in ni lo va, Lalpa tân a ni zâwk si a; rorêlnaah chuan in hnênah a tel zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa hlau ula, fîmkhur takin ti rawh u; Lalpa kan Pathianah chuan khawlohna leh thlei bîk neihna leh tham einate a awm lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chuan Jerusalem-ah Lalpa rorêl tûr leh thubuaite remtu atân Levi-hote, puithiamte, Israel chhûngkaw puipate a dah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, “ Lalpa ṭih chungin rinawm takin, rilru dik tak puin in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawii khuaa mi pawhin thubuai an rawn sawia, tualthah te, dân leh thupêk thûah te, thuruat leh rorêl thûah te an rawn inkhin chuan, Lalpa chungah thil an tihsual loh nân fimkhur tûrin hrilh ang che u, nangmahni leh in unaute chungah thinurna a lo thleng dah rual ang e; chutiang chuan ti ula, thiam loh in chang dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, Lalpa lam thu zawng zawngah chuan puithiam lalber Amaria chu in hotu a ni a; tin, lal lam thu zawng zawngah chuan Juda-te chhûngkaw chunga rorêltu chu Ismaela fapa Zebadia a ni; Levi-hote pawh in hotute an ni ve ang. Huai takin ti ula, mi ṭhate hnênah chuan Lalpa chu awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, Moaba thlahte leh Amona thlahte chu Meun-ho ṭhenkhatte nên Jehosaphata bei tûrin an lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, tuten emaw Jehosaphata hnênah, “Nangmah bei tûrin mipui tam tak mai, tuifinriat râl Suria aṭangin an lo thawk chiam mai; ngai teh, Hazazon-tamar-ah an awm tawh,” tiin an hrilh a (chu chu En-gedi an ti bawk ṭhîn).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chuan a hlau va, Lalpa zawng tûrin a inpe a; Judai ram zawng zawngah chaw nghei tûr thu a than vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Juda-te chu Lalpa ṭanpuina zawngin an pung khâwm a; Juda khaw tin aṭangin Lalpa zawng tûrin an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chu Lalpa inah, kawt hung chhûng thar bulah Juda-ho leh Jerusalem-ho pung khâwm zîngah chuan a ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , kan pi leh pute Pathian, vâna Pathian i ni lâwm ni? Hnam tin chunga rorêltu i ni lâwm ni? I kutah chuan thiltihtheihna leh chakna a awm a, tu ma chelh rual i ni lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw kan Pathian, he rama chêngte hi i mi Israel-te i hnawh chhuahsak a, i ṭhian Abrahama thlahte chatuan atân i pe a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, he ramah hian an lo awm ta a, ‘Kan chungah thil ṭha lo, khandaiha rorêlna te emaw, hri te emaw, ṭâm te emaw a lo thlen chuan he in bulah leh i hmaah kan lo ding ang a (he inah hian i hming a awm si a), kan mangannaah chuan kan au vang chia, nangin min ngaihthlâksakin min chhandam ang chu,’ tiin i hming tân hmun thianghlim an dinsak chia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, ngai teh, Amona thlahte leh Moab-ho leh Seir tlânga mi, Israel-ho Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah laia beih i phal lohva, an kîrsana an tihboral tâk lohhoten,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kan luah atâna i ram min pêk ata hnawh chhuaha mi rawn thungrulh an tum dân hi lo hre teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw kan Pathian, an chungah ro i rêl dâwn lâwm ni? Mi chu zozai, mi rawn bei tûra lo thawkte chu han bei thei ziazâng kan ni si lo va; a tih ngaihna rêng rêng kan hre bawk hek lo, i lam kan lo hawi mai zâwk a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te zawng zawng chu an fanau tê tê, an nupuite leh an fate nên Lalpa hmaah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipui zînga Jahaziela chungah chuan Lalpa thlarau a lo thleng a, chu mi chu Zekaria fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Benaia fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Jeiela fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Asapha thlah Levi mi Matania fapa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Nangni Judai rama mi zawng zawng leh Jerusalem-a awm zawng zawngte leh nang, Lal Jehosaphat, lo ngaithla rawh u! Lalpan in hnênah heti hian a ti: ‘Hlau suh ula, chûng mipui tam tak avâng chuan zâm hek suh u; indona chu nangni indona a ni lo va, Pathian indona a ni zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naktûkah zuk bei rawh u; ngai teh u, Ziz pan chhohnaah an lo chho va, Jeruel thlalêr bul ruam tâwp lamah chuan in zu hmu ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He indona hi in beih a ngai lo vang. Inzâr ula, ding ngawt mai ula, in lama ṭang Lalpa chhandamna chu en reng mai rawh u, aw Juda mite leh Jerusalem mite u!’ tiin. Hlau suh ula, zâm hek suh u. Naktûkah bei tûrin thawk rawh u, Lalpa chu in lamah a ṭang si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jehosaphata chu a hmaia lei siin a kûn a; tin, Juda mite zawng zawng leh Jerusalem mi zawng zawng chu Lalpa chibai bûkin Lalpa hmaah an kûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Kohatha thlah leh Kora thlah Levi-hote chu aw ring taka Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian fak tûrin an lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan zîng takah an tho va, Tekoa thlalêrah an lût a; tin, an kal lai chuan Jehosaphata chu a ding a, “Aw, Juda mite leh Jerusalem mite u, ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u; Lalpa in Pathian chu ring ula, nghet takin in awm dâwn nia; a zâwlneite chu ring ula, hmuingîl takin in awm dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, mipuite a fuih zawh chuan sipaite hmaa kal chunga Lalpa chawimawina leh a thianghlim mawizia fak tûra hla satu tûrte a ruat a, “ Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu sawi rawh u, a ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a, ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, hla an saka an han fak veleh chuan Amona thlah te, Moaba thlah te, Seir tlânga mite, Juda-ho bei tûra lo thawkte châng rutu tûr Lalpan a dah a; tichuan, an tlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amona thlahte leh Moaba thlahte chuan Seir tlânga awmte chu thah chimih vek leh tihboral dêr tumin an bei ta mai a; tin, Seir tlânga mite an tihboral zawh chuan anmahni leh anmahni chu intihboral tumin an inbei ta chiam mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chuan thlalêr thlîrna hmun sâng an han thlen chuan mipui lam chu an han en a; tin, ngai teh, mitthi ruang chu leiah chuan a lum rum mai a, pakhat tê mah tlân chhuak an awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehosaphata leh a hote chu râllâk sum la tûrin an va kal a, an zîngah chuan sum leh pai te, silhfên te, lunghlu te an va hmu ta ṭeuh mai a, an phurh zawh loh khawpin an la a; a tam khawp a, ni thum zet râllâk sum chu an chhêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a ni li ni chuan Beraka ruamah an inkhâwm a, chutah chuan Lalpa chu an chawimawi a; chumi avâng chuan tûn thleng hian chumi hmun hmingah chuan Beraka ruam an ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda mi leh Jerusalem mi zawng zawng chu an haw leh ta a; tin, Jehosaphata chuan Jerusalem-a hlim taka haw tûrin an hma a hruai a; Lalpan an hmêlmate chung thûah hlim taka a awmtîr tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, perhkhuang te, ṭingṭang te, tawtawrâwtte nên Jerusalem-a Lalpa in chu an han thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Israel-te hmêlma a bei tih an han hriat chuan ram tina mite chuan Pathian chu an hlau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehosaphata ram chu râlmuangin a awm ta a; a Pathianin an vêla mite laka râlmuanna a pêk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jehosaphata chu Juda-te chungah a lal ta a; kum sawmthum leh kum nga mi a nihin a lal ṭan a; tin, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh kum nga a lal a; a nu hming chu Azubi, Silhia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha tiin a pa Asa kawng chu pênsan hauh lovin a zawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hmun sângte chu thehthang bo a ni lo va, mipuite pawhin an pi leh pute Pathian chungah an thinlung an la nghat bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, Jehosaphata thiltih zawng zawng chu a bul aṭanga a tawp thlengin, Hanania fapa Jehua chanchin ziaknaah a chuang a, chu chu Israel lalte chanchin buah a chuang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Juda lal Jehosaphata chuan Israel lal Ahazia a thurualpui a; chu mi chuan ṭha lo takin thil a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Tarsis lama kal tûr lawng an siam tlâng a, Ezion-geber-ah lawngte chu an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutichuan, Maresa mi Dodavahua fapa Eliezeran Jehosaphata hnênah, “Ahazia i thurualpui avângin Lalpan i thiltih tum hi a tihkhawlohsak ta che a ni,” a ti a. Tichuan, lawngte chu a chhe ta vek a, Tarsis-ah chuan an kal thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, a pute zîngah a pu Davida khawpuiah an phûm a. Tichuan, a fapa Jehorama chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan unau, Jehosaphata fapate a nei hlawm a, Azaria te, Jehiela te, Zekaria te, Azariahua te, Mikaela te, Sephatia te an ni. Hêng zawng zawng hi Israel lal Jehosaphata fapate vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, an pa chuan thil ropui tak a pe a, tangkarua te, rangkachak te, thil hlu tak tak te, Judai rama kulh nei khuate nên; nimahsela, ram chu Jehorama hnênah fa u ber a nih avângin a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jehoraman a pa ram a han luah chuan a lo intichak ta a, a unaute zawng zawng chu Israel-te zînga puipa tam takte nên khandaihin a tihlum vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehorama chu kum sawmthum leh kum hnih a nihin a lal ṭan a; Jerusalem-ah kum riat a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahaba chhûngte tih angin Israel lalte kawng chu a zawh ve a, Ahaba fanu nupuiah a nei a ni; tichuan, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan Davida chhûngkua chu a tiboral duh lo va, Davida hnêna thuthlung avâng leh amah leh a thlahte chena khâwnvâr neihtîr reng a lo tiam tawh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama chhanah chuan Edom-ho chu Juda-te lakah an hel a, lal an insiam chawp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehorama chu a sipai hotute leh a tawlailîr zawng zawngte nên a va thawk chhuak a, zânah a va thawk a, anmahni leh tawlailîr chunga hotute hualtu Edom-hote chu a va bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Edom-hote chu tûn thlengin Juda-te lakah an la hel ta reng a ni; tin, Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian chu a hawisan avângin, chumi lai bawk chuan Libna khua pawh a lakah an hel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Judai ram tlângahte hmun sâng a siam a, Jerusalem mite chu a uiretîr a, Juda-te chu a hruai bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Elija aṭangin a hnênah lehkha a lo thleng a, “ Lalpa , i pu Davida Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘I pa Jehosaphata kawngte i zawh lo va, Juda-te lal Asa kawngte pawh i zawh bawk hek lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel lalte kawng i zawh zâwka, Juda-te leh Jerusalem-a awmte Ahaba chhûngte anga i uiretîra, i unau, i pa chhûngte, i aia ṭha zâwk i thah bawk avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ngai teh, Lalpan i mite - i fate, i nupuite leh i rante hripuiin a hrem ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tin, nangin rîl natna nasa tak i nei ang a, ni tin chu natna avânga i rîl chu a tlâk a tlâka, a tlâk zawh vek thlengin,’” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ethiopia mite kiang vêla mi Philistia-ho leh Arabia-ho rilru chu Jehorama bei tûrin Lalpan a chawk tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Juda-te chu an han bei a, an ramah an lût a, lal ina thil zawng zawng chu an la vek a, a fapate, a nupuite pawh; chutichuan, a fapa naupang ber Jehoahaza chauh lo chu a fa pawh an hnutchhiahsak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan Lalpan tihdam theih loh rîl natnain a hrem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a kum hnihna a lo vei hnuin a natna avâng chuan a rîl chu a tla ta a, natna râpthlâk takin a lo thi ta a. A mite chuan a pute meipui an chhehsak ang khân an chhehsak ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lal tirhin kum sawmthum leh kum hnih a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum riat a lal a; tu ma ui hlawh lovin a thi a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a, lalho thlânah erawh chuan a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jerusalem mite chuan a fapa naupang ber Ahazia chu a aiah lalah an siam a; a fa ûte zawng zawng chu sipai rual, Arabia mite nêna an ṭanhmuna lo kalho chuan an that ta vek si a. Chutichuan, Juda lal Jehorama fapa Ahazia chu a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahazia chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmli leh kum hnih a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum khat a lal a; a nu hming chu Athali, Omria fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani pawh chuan Ahaba chhûngte kawng zawh chu a zawh ve a; a nu chu thil sual taka ti tûra kaihruaitu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahaba chhûngkuate tih ang bawkin Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo a ti a; a pa thih hnuin a chhiatna tûra kaihruaitu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An kaihhruai ang chuan a awm bawk a, Ramoth-gilead-ah Suria lal Hazaela do tûrin Israel lal Ahaba fapa Jehorama hnênah a kal a; tichuan, Suria-ho chuan Jehorama chu an lo hliam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suria lal Hazaela a va beihnaa Rama-a an lo hliam tidam tûrin Jezreel-ah a kal a. Tichuan, Juda lal Jehorama fapa Azaria chu Ahaba fapa Jehorama a damloh avâng chuan a kan tûrin Jezreel-ah chuan a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahazia Jehorama hnêna a kala, a boralna chu Pathian tih a ni a; Nimsia fapa Jehua bei tûrin Jehorama hnênah a kal avângin. Chu mi chu Ahaba chhûngte timang tûra Lalpa ruat a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Ahaba chhûngte tichhe tûra a beih laiin Juda puipate leh Ahazia unau fapatehovin Ahazia rawng an bâwl lai a hmu a, a that ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahazia chu an zawng a, an man a (Samari-ah a biru a ni), Jehua hnênah an rawn hruai a, an that a; tin, “A thinlung zawng zawnga Lalpa zawng ṭhîn Jehosaphata fapa a ni si,” an ti a, a phûmin an phûm a. Tichuan, Ahazia chhûngte chuan an ramah thuneihna an nei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Ahazia nu Athali chuan a fapa a thi tih a lo hriat chuan a tho va, Juda lal zawng zawng chu a that ta vek mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahazia fapa Joasa erawh chu lal fanu Jehosabeathi chuan lal fapa an thahte zîng ata chu a hruai bo va, a enkawltu nên khum pindanah a thukru hlauh mai a. Chutichuan, lal Jehorama fanu Jehosabeathi, puithiam Jehoiada nupuiin (Ahazia farnu a ni a) Athali hmuh theih loh tûrin a thukru a; tichuan, an that ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an hnêna chêngin Pathian inah kum ruk a rûkin a awm a; tichuan, Athali chu an ramah chuan a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum sarih kumah chuan Jehoiada chu a intichak a, sipai za hotu, Jehorama fapa Azaria te, Jehohanana fapa Ismaela te, Obeda fapa Azaria te, Adaia fapa Maaseia te, Zikria fapa Elisaphata te hnênah thu a thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Judai ram an fang a; Judai ram khaw tina Levi-hote leh Israel-te chhûngkaw puipate an khâwm a, Jerusalem an han thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, pung khâwmho zawng zawng chuan Pathian inah lal hnênah chuan thu an thlung a. Tin, an hnênah, “Ngai teh u, Lalpan Davida fapate chungchâng thu a lo sawi angin lal fapa chu a lal tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In tih tûr chu hetiang hi a ni: puithiamte leh Levi-ho Chawlhnia lo kal ṭhînte chu hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat kawngkhâr vêngtute in ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu lal inah in awm ang a; tin, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu kulh kawngkaah; tin, mipui zawng zawng chu Lalpa in kawt hung chhûngah an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, puithiamte leh rawngbâwltu Levi-hote chauh lo chu tu mah Lalpa inah lût suh se; anni chu an thianghlim avângin an lût ang a, mipui zawng zawng erawh chu Lalpa ngaichângin an awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hovin an hriamhrei kengin lal chu an din hual ang a; tin, tu pawh ina lo lût chu thah tûr a ni. Tin, lal chu a chhuah leh a luhin a hnênah awm zêl rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Levi-ho leh Juda zawng zawngte chuan puithiam Jehoiada thupêk ang zawng zawng chuan an ti a; tin, mahni hote ṭheuh Chawlhnia lo kal tûrte leh Chawlhnia ṭîn tûrte chu an hruai a; puithiam Jehoiada chuan a ṭîn tûr pâwl chu a la ṭîntîr si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Jehoiada chuan sipai za hotute chu Lalpa ina awm Lal Davida fei leh phaw tê leh phaw liante chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mite chu hriamhrei keng ṭheuhvin in ding lampang aṭangin vei lampang thlengin maichâm leh in hualin lal chu a din hualtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal fapa chu an rawn hruai chhuak a, lallukhum an khumtîr a, thuhriattîrna chu an pe a, lalah an siam a, Jehoiada leh a fapate chuan hriak an thih a, “Pathianin lal chu humhim rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Athalin mipui lal chawimawia an zi mur mur thâwm chu a hriatin Lalpa inah mipui zîngah chuan a va kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, a han en a, ngai teh, kawngkaa ban bulah lal chu a ding a, a kiangah sipai hotute leh tawtawrâwt hâmtute nên; tin, chumi rama mi zawng zawng chu an hlim êm êm a, tawtawrâwtte an hâm dur dur a; tin, hla satute chuan an thil ri theite tumin fakna hla an sa ho va. Tichuan, Athali chuan a puante a pawt thlêr a, “Phiarrûkna! Phiarrûkna a ni ta le!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Jehoiada chuan sipaite chunga hotua ruat sipai za hotute chu a hruai chhuak a, an hnênah, “Sipaihote kârah chhuahtîr ula; tin, tu pawh a zui apiang chu khandaiha sah hlum ni rawh se,” a ti a; puithiam chuan, “ Lalpa inah zawng thah tûr a ni lo ve,” a lo ti tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, kawng an kian a; tin, sakawr luhna kawngkaah lal inah a kal a, chutah chuan an that a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiada chuan amah leh mipui zawng zawng leh lal kârah chuan Lalpa mite ni tûrin thu a thlung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawng chu Baala inah an kal a, an tichhia a, a maichâm te, a lemte an tisawm dep a, Baala puithiam Matana chu maichâm bulah an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiada chuan, Mosia dân bua a ziak anga hlim tak leh hla sa chunga Davidan Lalpa ina Lalpa hnêna hâlral thilhlan tûra a lo ruat, puithiam Levi-ho hnuaia thawk tûrin Davida thupêk angin Lalpa biak in vêngtu tûrte chu a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thianghlim lo tawh phawt chu an luh loh nân Lalpa in kawngkhâr vêngtute a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, za chunga hotu te, mi ṭha te, mipui awptute chumi rama mi zawng zawngte chu a hruai a, Lalpa ina lal chu an han hruai thla a; kawngkhâr chhakta zâwkah lal in lamah an kal a, lal chu an ram lalṭhutthlêngah chuan a ṭhuttîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, chu rama mi zawng zawng chu hlim takin an awm a, khua chu râlmuangin a awm ta a; Athali chu khandaihin an that a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joasa chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sarih mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmli a lal a; a nu hming chu Zibi, Beer-seba-a mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Joasa chuan puithiam Jehoiada dam chhûng chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil ṭha a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiada chuan nupui pahnih a neihsak a, fanu leh fapate a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chumi zawhah chuan Joasa chuan Lalpa in siam ṭhat a rilrûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puithiamte leh Levi-ho a ko khâwm a, “Juda-ho khuaahte kal ula, kum tina in Pathian in siam ṭhat nân Israel mi zawng zawng hnênah tangka va khawn khâwm rawh u khai, muangchâng suh ang che u,” a ti a. Nimahsela, Levi-hote chu an hmanhmawh chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan puithiam lalber Jehoiada chu a ko va, a hnênah, “Engati nge Levi-hote chu Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosia leh Israel mipuite ruat hriattîrna puan in atâna thawh bi ruat chu, Juda mi leh Jerusalem-a mite thawh tûrin i phût loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi sualnu Athali fapate chuan Pathian in chu an tichhe zo ta si a; tin, Lalpa ina thilhlan zawng zawng chu Baala te an pe zo ta bawk si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, lalin thu a pe a, bâwm an siam a, Lalpa in kawngka pâwn lamah chuan an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, thlalêra Pathian chhiahhlawh Mosian Israel mite tih tûra thawh bi a ruat chu Lalpa tâna rawn thawh tûrin, Judai ram zawng zawng leh Jerusalem-ah thu a than vêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, mi liante leh mipuite chu an lâwm a, an tangka te an rawn la a, an khawn zawh hma chuan bâwmah chuan an rawn dah ta ruih ruih mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hoten lal puipate hnênah bâwm chu an rawn lâka, tangka tam tak a awm tih an hriat chuan, lal lehkhaziaktu leh puithiam lal ruat puipa chuan bâwm ata an bun chhuak a, an la a, a hmunah chuan an dah leh a. Chutiang chuan ni tin an ti a, tangka chu tam tak an khâwl khâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, lal leh Jehoiada chuan Lalpa in hna thawktute kutah an pe a, Lalpa in siam ṭha tûrin lung chhertute leh themthiamte an ruai a; tin, Lalpa in siam ṭha tûrin thîr leh dâra themthiamte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, thawktute chuan an bei a, an thawk ṭha hle mai a, Pathian in chu a ngai chiahin an siam ṭha a, an din nghet leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, an zawh chuan tangka la awm zawng zawng chu lal leh Jehoiada hnênah an rawn la a, chu chuan Lalpa ina rawngbâwl nâna bungbêl te, hlanna bungbêl te, thîrfian te, rangkachak leh tangkaraw bungbêlte lamin an siam a. Tichuan, Jehoiada dam chhûng chuan Lalpa inah hâlral thilhlan chu an hlân reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jehoiada chu upa tak, tarkûna damin a thi ta a. A thih chuan kum za leh sawmthum mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Israel-te zîngah Pathian chungah leh a in chungchânga thil a tihṭhat avângin Davida khawpuiah lalte zîngah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiada thih hnu chuan Juda mi liante chu an lo thawk a, lal hnênah dawvân an rawn kai a. Lal chuan an thu chu a lo pawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, an pi leh pute Pathian, Lalpa in chu an hawisan a, Aseri-te leh milemte rawng an bâwl ta a; tin, an sualna avângin Juda-te leh Jerusalem chungah thinurna a lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa hnênah hruai leh tûrin an hnênah zâwlneite a tîr a, an thiam lohzia te an hriattîr a; nimahsela, an beng an chhi duh chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Jehoiada fapa Zekaria chungah Pathian thlarau a lo thleng a, ani chu mipui chung lamah a ding a, an hnênah, “Pathianin heti hian a ti: ‘Engati nge hmuingîl theih loh phaha Lalpa thupêk chu in bawhchhiat? Lalpa chu in hawisan avângin ani pawhin a hawisan che u a ni,’” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chu an phiar ta a, lal thupêkin Lalpa biak in hung chhungah chuan lungin an dêng hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Lal Joasa chuan Zekaria pa Jehoiada khawngaihna chu hre reng lovin a fapa chu a that ta a ni. Tin, a thih dâwn chuan, “ Lalpan a rawn ngaihtuah ang a, phuba a la rawn lâksak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum a lo vei chuan Suria sipaiten an rawn bei a; Judai ram leh Jerusalem-ah an lût a, an mi lian zawng zawngte chu an that a, Damaska lal hnênah an râllâk sum zawng zawngte chu an thawn ta vek mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Suria sipaite chu tlêm tê chauh an lo thawk a ni a; an pi leh pute Pathian, Lalpa chu an hawisan avângin Lalpan sipai tam tak maite chu an kutah a pe a ni. Chutiang chuan Joasa chungah hremna an thlentîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, an hawsan hnu chuan (natna nasa tak tuarin an hawsan a ni) ama mite ngeiin puithiam Jehoiada fapate thisen avâng khân an phiar a, a khuma a mu lai chu an that a, a thi ta a. Davida khawpuiah chuan an phûm a; nimahsela, lalte thlânah an phûm ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hêngte hi amah phiartute chu an ni: Amon mi Simeathi fapa Zabada leh Moab mi Simrithi fapa Jehozabada.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, a fapate chungchâng thûte, a chunga phurrit tak lo innghah chungchâng thûte, Pathian in a din ṭhat chungchâng thûte chu, ngai teh, lal chanchin hrilhfiahna buah chuan ziak a ni. Tichuan, a aiah a fapa Amazia chu a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amazia chu a lal ṭan tirh chuan kum sawmhnih leh kum nga mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh kum kua a lal a; a nu hming chu Jehoadani, Jerusalem mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa mit hmuhin thil ṭha a ti a; amaherawhchu, a rilru a pe famkim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni a, a ram chu a lo din ngheh chuan a pa thattu, a chhiahhlawhte a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, an fate chu a that lo va, Mosia lehkhabu, dâna chuang, “Fate avângin pate an thi tûr a ni lo va, pate avângin fate an thi tûr a ni hek lo, mi tin mahni sual avângin an thi tûr a ni,” tia Lalpan thu a pêk angin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Amazia chuan Juda-te chu a khâwm chiam a, Juda leh Benjamin mi zawng zawng an chhûngkaw zir zêlin sâng hotute hnuaiah te, za hotute hnuaiah te a awmtîr a; tin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam zawng a chhiar a, fei leh phaw lek thei, râlkai chin thlan ṭhiau mi nuai thum an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Israel rama mi, mi chak huaisen nuai khat, tangkaraw talent zain a ruai bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, a hnênah Pathian mi, mi pakhat a lo kal a, “Aw lalpa, Israel sipaite chu i hnênah kal ve suh se, Lalpa chu Israel mite (Ephraima thlahte zawng zawng huamin) hnênah chuan a awm si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kal pawh ni la, huai takin indonaah chuan che rawh! Chuti lo chuan, Pathianin hmêlma hmaah chuan a titlâwm mai ang che; Pathian chuan ṭanpui theihna leh tihtlâwm theihna a nei si a,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Amazian Pathian mi hnênah chuan, “A nih leh, Israel sipaite ka pêk tâk talent za chu engtin nge kan tih tâk ang?” a ti a. Tin, Pathian mi chuan, “ Lalpa chuan chu aia tam tak chu a pe thei che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Amazia chuan Ephraim ram aṭanga sipai lo kalte chu haw leh tûrin a tihrang a; chuvâng chuan Juda-te chungah chuan an thin a rim hle mai a, thinrim engphiarin an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Amazia chuan zâm lovin a mite chu a hruai chhuak a, Chi Ruamah an kal a, Seira thlahte sîngkhat an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, sîngkhat dang chu Juda-ten a nungin an man a, lungpui chhîpah an hruai a, lungpui chhîp aṭang chuan an nam thla chiam mai a, an keh sawm ta rem rum mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Amazian a hnêna râl kâp tûra kal ve lo tûra a hâwntîr sipaite chuan Judai ram khua te, Samari aṭanga Beth-horon thlengin an lo bei a, mi sângthum an that a, râllâk sum tam tak an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Amazia chu Edom-ho thata a lo haw chuan Seira thlahteho pathiante a rawn hâwn a, a pathian atân a din a, chibai a bûk a, rimtuite a hâlsak hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Amazia chungah chuan Lalpa thin a alh ta a, a hnênah zâwlnei a tîr a, chu mi chuan a hnênah, “I kut ata a mite pawh chhan chhuak thei hlei lo pathiante chu engah tehlul nge i zawn ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a hnêna thu a sawi lai mêk chuan lal chuan, “Lal rorêltuah kan siam che em ni? Ngawi mai rawh; engah nge i nun i chân dâwn?” a ti a. Tichuan, zâwlnei chuan, “Pathianin hetianga i tih avâng leh ka remruat i ngaihsân loh avângin tihboral che a rilrûk tih ka hria a ni,” a ti a, a ngawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda lal Amazia chuan a remruat chu a pawm a, Israel lal Jehua fapa Jehoahaza fa Joasa hnênah, “Hawh teh, hmai chhanah i lo inen teh ang,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal Joasa chuan Juda lal Amazia hnênah, “Lebanon tlâng hlîngin Lebanon tlânga sidar thing hnênah, ‘I fanu kha ka fapa nupuiah neihtîr teh khai,’ tiin a chah a; tin, Lebanon tlânga ramsa a lo kal a, hlîng chu a rawn chîl thlu ta dêr mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang hian, ‘Ngai teh, Edom chu ka hneh,’ tiin i chapo a nih hi, i inah tawm hle hle mai rawh; nang leh Juda ram chawp chawpa chhiatna, i tâna pawi tûr thil engah nge i chawh chhuah dâwn ni?” tiin mi a tîr ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Amazia chuan a lo ngaithla duh lo va; Edom-ho pathiante a zawn avânga Judai ram chu an hmêlmate kuta a pêk theihna tûra Pathian tih a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel lal Joasa chu a han chho va; Juda lal Amazia nên chuan Judai ram Beth-semes khuaah hmai chhanah an inen ta ngei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chan chu Israel-te ai chuan a lo chhe ta zâwk a; mi tin mahni in lamah an tlân haw ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal Joasa chuan Juda lal, Ahazia fapa Jehoasa fa Amazia chu Beth-semes-ah chuan a man a, Jerusalem-ah a hruai a, Jerusalem kulh chu Ephraim kulh kawngka aṭanga kulh kil kawngka thlengin tawng zali zet a tichim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Obed-edoma enkawl Lalpa ina mi bâkah lal ina ro dah khâwmnaa mi, rangkachak leh tangkarua leh bungbêl awm zawng zawng a la a, hrênga tâng tûrte a hruai bawk a; tin, Samari khuaah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Joasa fapa Amazia chu Israel-te lal Jehoahaza fapa Joasa thih hnuin kum sâwm leh kum nga a la dam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, Amazia thiltih dangte chu a bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin, ngai teh, Juda lal leh Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, Amazian Lalpa zui a bânsan veleh Jerusalem-ah chuan an phiar a, Lakis khuaah a tlân a; nimahsela, Lakis khuaah chuan mi an ûmtîr a, chutah chuan an that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, a ruang chu sakawrin an phur a, a pi leh pute hnênah Juda khawpuiah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Juda mi zawng zawng chuan kum sâwm leh kum ruk mi Uzia chu an hruai a, a pa Amazia aiah lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan lal chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muthilh hnuah Eloth khua chu a siam ṭha a, Judai ramah a telh leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzia chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sâwm leh kum ruk mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmnga leh kum hnih a lal a, a nu hming chu Jekoli, Jerusalem mi a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a pa Amazia thiltih ang apiang ti vein Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian inlârna hre thiam Zekaria dam chhûng chuan Pathian zawng tûrin a insiam tlat a; Pathian a zawn chhûng zawng chuan Pathianin a tihmuingîl zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Philistia-ho rûn tûrin a thawk chhuak a, Gath kulh te, Jabne kulh te, Asdod kulh te a tichim a; tin, Asdod ramah leh Philistia-ho zîngahte khua a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Philistia-hote lakah leh Gur-baal-a awm Arabia-ho leh Meun-ho lakahte a ṭanpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Amon-hote chuan Uzia lakah chhiah an chawi ṭhîn a; tichuan, a lo chak tâk êm avângin Aigupta ram thlengin a hming a thang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Uzia chuan Jerusalem-ah Kil Kawngkaah te, Ruam Kawngkaah te, kulh kawina lai kawngkaah te in sâng a sa bawk a, kulhin a hung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, thlalêrah pawh in sâng a sa a, ran tam tak a neih avângin tui te a lai chhuak thluah mai a, phai lam leh phaizâwlahte pawh; tin, lo nei mite leh uain sâwr mite tlâng lamah leh ram ṭhaahte chuan a nei a, thlawhhma lam ngaina mi tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Uzia chuan sipai indo mi, lal sipai hotu Hanania hnuaia mi, lehkhaziaktu Jeiela leh hotu Maaseia-ten an ruat ang zêla a pâwl pâwla râl kâp mi a nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi chak huaisen ṭhiau, an chhûngkaw puipa zawng zawng chu sînghnih leh sângruk an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, an hnuaiah chuan sipai zir thiam sa ṭhiau nuai thum leh sângsarih leh zanga hmêlma laka lal ṭanpuitu râl bei mi tak tak an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Uzia chuan sipai zawng zawng tân phaw te, thal ngul te, virvawm atân lungte a buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem-ah in sâng leh kulh kil tina daha thal lo kahna leh lung lian fe fea lo denna tûr, mi fingte hriat chhuah khâwlte a siam a. A hming chu ram tin ram tangah a thang ta a; a lo chak hle thlengin a mak a maka ṭanpuiin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, a lo chak tâk hnu chuan a rilru a lo sâng ta a, ṭha lo takin thil a ti a, Lalpa a Pathian chungah thil a tisual ta a; maichâma rimtui hâl tûrin Lalpa biak inah a lût ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Azaria chuan a zui a, mi huai tak tak Lalpa puithiam sawmriat an tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Lal Uzia chu an khap a, a hnênah, “Uzi, Lalpa tâna rimtui hâl hi i tih tûr a ni lo va, rimtui hâl tûra tihhran Arona fapa puithiamte tih tûr a ni zâwk e. Hmun thianghlim ata hi chhuak rawh, thil i tisual a nih hi! Lalpa Pathian laka i ropuina tûr pawh a ni hek lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Uzia chu a thinur ta a; rimtui hâlna tûr mei lâkna a keng a. Tin, chutia puithiamte chunga a thinur lai tak chuan Lalpa inah, rimtui hâlna bulah puithiamte hmaah chuan a chalah a lo phâr chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, puithiam hotu Azaria leh puithiam zawng zawng chuan an han en a, ngai teh, a chalah chuan a lo phâr a; chuta ṭang chuan an nam chhuak ta thuai a. A ni, Lalpan a hrem avângin amah pawh hmanhmawh tak bawkin a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Lal Uzia chu a thih ni thlengin a lo phâr ta a. A phâr avângin in hrangah a awm ta a; Lalpa in ata chu tihchhuah a ni a. Tichuan, a fapa Jothama chu an rama mite rorêlin lal ina awptuah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Uzia thiltih dang zawng zawngte chu a bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaian a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Uzia chu a pi leh a pute hnênah chuan a muhîl a, lal inphûmna hmuna a pi leh a pute zîngah an phûm a, “Ani zawng phâr a ni si a,” an ti a. Tichuan, a fapa Jothama chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jothama chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum nga mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum ruk a lal a; a nu hming chu Jerusi, Zadoka fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a pa Uzia thiltih ang apiang ti vein Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha a ti ṭhîn a. Lalpa biak inah erawh chuan a lût ve lo. Nimahsela, mite chuan ṭha lo takin thil an la ti fo mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa ina kawngkhâr chhakta zâwk a siam a; tin, Ophel kulh chungah chuan in tam tak a sa bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Judai tlâng ramah khuate a siam a, ramhnuaiah in ropui tak tak te, in sâng te a sa bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahte lal a do va; a hneh a. Tin, Amona thlahte chuan chumi kum chuan tangkarua talent za leh buh phur sîng leh barli phur sîngkhat an pe a. Chutiang bawk chuan Amona thlahte chuan a kum hnihna leh a kum thumnaah pawh an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jothama chuan Lalpa a Pathian hmaa a kawng a rêl fel avângin a lo chak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Jothama thiltih dang zawng zawng, a râl do zawng zawngte, a awm dân zawng zawngte chu, ngai teh, Israel leh Juda lalte chanchin ziakna buah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lal ṭan tirhin kum sawm hnih leh kum nga mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum ruk a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Jothama chu a pi leh a pute hnênah a muhîl a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a. Tichuan, a fapa Ahaza chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaza chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum ruk a lal a; a pu Davida angin Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha a ti ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel lalte kawng a zawh zâwk a, Baala-te tân milem chhûn chawpte a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinoma fapa ruamah rimtui te a hâl a Lalpan Israela thlahte hmaa a hnawh chhuah tâk hnamten thil tenawm tak an tih ṭhin angin a fate meiah a luhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, hmun sângah te, tlângah te, thing hring tin hnuaiah te a inthawi a, rimtuite a hâl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa a Pathianin Suria lal kutah a pe a; an bei a, a mite tam tak salah an hruai a, Damaska-ah an kalpui a. Tin, Israel lal kutah pêk a ni bawk a, ani chuan tam tak a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Remalia fapa Peka chuan Judai ramah nuai khat leh sînghnih ni khatah a that a, an za chuan mi huaisen ṭheuh an ni; an pi leh pute Lalpa Pathian chu an hawisan vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Ephraim mi chak Zikrian lal fapa Maaseia leh in chhûng puipa Azrikama leh Elkana, lal dawttu chu a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahten an unaute nuai hnih, hmeichhia te, an fapa te, an fanute salah an hruai a; râllâk tam tak an lâksak bawk a, râllâk chu Samari-ah an thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, chutah chuan Lalpa zâwlnei a lo awm a, a hming chu Odeda a ni; Samari-a lo kal tûr sipaite chu a va hmuak a, an hnênah, “Ngai teh u, Lalpa , in pi leh pute Pathian chu Juda-te chungah a thinur a, in kutah a pe che u a ni a, thinrima in thahna chuan vân a han tawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Juda leh Jerusalem mite chu bâwihnu leh bâwihpaa siam in tum a; nimahsela, nangni ngei pawh hian Lalpa in Pathian chungah in tisual ve a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thu hi pawm ula, in unau sala in mante hi hâwntîr leh rawh u, Lalpa thinurna nasa tak mai chu in chungah a awm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Ephraim-ho hotu ṭhenkhat, Johanana fapa Azaria te, Mesilemotha fapa Berekia te, Saluma fapa Jehizkia te, Hadlaia fapa Amasa te chuan indona aṭanga lo hawte chu an lo kalh ve bawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an hnênah, “Salte chu in rawn hruai lût tûr a ni lo, kan sual leh kan bawhchhiatna belhchhahin Lalpa chungah bawhchhiatna min thlensak dâwn a ni; kan sualna chu a nasa hle si a, Israel mite chungah thinurna nasa tak a awm a ni,” an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, sipaite chuan mi liante leh mipui hmaah chuan salte leh râllâk sumte chu an hnutchhiah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an hming lam tâkhote chu an lo tho va, salte chu an hruai a, râllâk thil chuanin saruaka awm zawngte chu silhfên an bân a, an tuam a, pheikhawkte an buntîr a, ei tûr leh in tûr an pe a, hriak te an thih a, a chhiaṭhate zawng zawng chu sabengtungah an chuantîr a, tûm khua Jeriko-a an unaute hnênah an kaltîr ta a; tin, anni chu Samari-ah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Lal Ahaza chuan Suria lalte ṭanpuia sâwm tûrin mi a tîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Edom-ho chuan Juda-ho chu an han beiha, salah te an rawn man leh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Philistia-hote pawhin phai lam khuate leh Juda Chhim te an rawn la a, Beth-semes te, Aijalon te, Gederoth te, Soko te a khawperte nên; tin, Timna leh a khawper te, Gimzo pawh a khawperte nên an la a, chûngah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda lal Ahaza khan Juda-te dik lo takin a timualpho fo va, Lalpa chungah thil sual nasa tak a tih avâng khân Lalpan Juda-te chu a titlâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Assuria lal Tilgath-pilnesera a hnênah a kal a, tihchak ahnêkin a timangang zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahaza chuan Lalpa in leh lal in leh mi lian ina mi thilte a la a, Assuria lal a pe a; nimahsela, a sâwt chuang si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A mangan lai tak te pawh chuan he Lal Ahaza hian Lalpa chungah thil a la tisual deuh deuh ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah beitu Damaska-ho pathian hnênah te a inthawi a; “Suria lalte pathian chuan anmahni a puih avângin mi puih ve theih nân an hnênah ka inthawi dâwn a ni,” te a ti a. Nimahsela, amah leh Israel mi zawng zawng chhiatna a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Ahaza chuan Pathian ina bungbêlte chu a khâwm vek a, Pathian ina bungbêlte chu a tisawm vek a, Lalpa in kawngkhârte chu a khâr tlat a; tin, Jerusalem kil tinah maichâm a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Juda khaw tam takah chuan pathian dangte tân rimtui hâl nân hmun sângte a siam a, Lalpa , a pi leh pute Pathian a tithinur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thiltih dang zawng zawng leh a awm dân zawng zawng, a bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin, ngai teh, Juda leh Israel lalte chanchin buah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Ahaza chu a pi leh a pute hnênah a muhîl a, Jerusalem khawpuiah chuan an phûm a; Israel lalte thlânah chuan an dah lo a ni. Tichuan, a fapa Hezekia chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekia chu kum sawmhnih leh kum nga mi a nihin a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh kum kua a lal a; a nu hming chu Abiji, Zekaria fanu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a pu Davida thiltih apiang ti vein Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan a lal ṭan kum thla khatnaah Lalpa in kawngkhârte chu a hawng a, a chei ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Puithiamte leh Levi-hote a hruai lût a, chhak lampang hmun zau laiah a hruai khâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />an hnênah, “Nangni Levi-hote u, ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u! Nangmahni intithianghlim phawt ula; tin, Lalpa , in pi leh pute Pathian in hi tithianghlim ula, hmun thianghlim ata bawlhhlawhte hi paih chhuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan pi leh pute chuan thil an lo tisual ta a, Lalpa kan Pathian mit hmuha thil ṭha lo chu an lo ti a, an lo hawisan a, Lalpa awmna chu an hawisan a, an lo hnuchhawn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hulhliap kawngkhârte chu an khâr a, khâwnvârte chu an timit a, Israel-te Pathian hmun thianghlimah chuan rimtuite an hâl lo va, hâlral thilhlante an hlân lo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Lalpa thinurna chu Juda-te leh Jerusalem chungah a awm a, in mita in hmuh ang hian, ram tin ram tanga tei tei tûr leh mak tih atân leh nuihzatbûr atân a lo siam ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh u, kan pi leh pute chu khandaiha tihtlâwmin an lo awm a, kan fanu leh kan fapate, kan nupuite chu chûng avâng chuan salah an lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai teh u, a thinurna nasa tak chu a kian theih nân Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian hnênah thuthlun ka tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka naute u, ngûrchuai suh u, Lalpa chuan, a rawngbâwltu in ni a, a hmaa a rawngbâwla awm tûr leh rimtui hâltuah a thlang tawh che u a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Levi mi Amasaia fapa Mahatha te, Kohath mi Azaria fapa Joela te, Meraria fapate zînga Abdia fapa Kisa te, Jehalelela fapa Azaria te, Gerson mi Zima fapa Joa te, Joa fapa Edena te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elizaphana fapate zînga mi Simria leh Jeiela te, Asapha fapate zînga mi Zekaria leh Matania te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hemana fapate zînga mi Jehuela leh Simeia te, Jeduthuna fapate zînga mi Semaia leh Uziela te chu an thawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An unaute an ko khâwm a, an intithianghlim a, Lalpa thûa lal thupêk anga Lalpa in tifai tûrin an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte chu a tifai tûrin Lalpa in chhûngril lamah an lût a, Lalpa biak ina thil bawlhhlawh an hmuh zawng zawng chu Lalpa in kawtah an la chhuak a. Tin, Levi-hovin an la a, Kidron luiah an kalpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thla khatna ni khat nîah an bei ṭan a, chumi thla ni riat nîah Lalpa hulhliap an bei thleng a; tichuan, ni riatah Lalpa in chu an tithianghlim a; thla khatna, ni sâwm leh ni ruk nîah an zo vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Hezekia hnênah lal inah an lût a, “ Lalpa in chu kan tifai zo ta vek e, hâlral thilhlan hlanna maichâm te, chumia bungbêl zawng zawng te, chhang chhiahna dawhkân te, chumia hmanrua zawng zawngte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lal Ahazan a lal laia thil a tihsuala, a thehthang bo bungbêl zawng zawngte pawh kan din leh vek a, kan tithianghlim bawk a; tin, ngai teh, Lalpa maichâm hma lamah a awm e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Hezekia chu zîng takah a tho va, khuaa mi lianhote chu a ko khâwm a, Lalpa inah chuan an chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ram leh hmun thianghlim leh Juda-hote tâna sual thawina tûr, bâwngpa pasarih leh berâmpa pasarih leh berâmno pasarih leh kêlpa pasarih an kai chho va. Tin, Arona fapa puithiamte chu Lalpa maichâma hlân tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, bâwngpate chu an talh a, puithiamte chuan thisen chu an la a, maichâm chu an theh a; tin, berâmpate pawh chu an talh a, a thisen chuan maichâm chu an theh a; tin, berâmnote pawh chu an talh a, a thisen chuan maichâm chu an theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, kêlpate chu sual thawi nân lal leh mipuiho kiangah chuan an rawn kai hnai a, an chungah chuan an kut an nghat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte chuan an talh a, an thisen chuan Israel mi zawng zawng tâna remna siam nân maichâmah sual thawina an hlan a; Israel mi zawng zawng tân hâlral thilhlan leh sual thawina siam tûrin lal chuan thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Davida leh lal zâwlnei Gada leh zâwlnei Nathana thupêk angin, Lalpa inah chuan Levi-ho chu dârbenthek te, perhkhuang te, ṭingṭangte tum tûrin a dah a; thupêk chu a zâwlneite hmanga Lalpa pêk a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Levi-ho chu Davida siam thil tum rîk mi nên an ding a, puithiamte chu tawtawrâwt nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chuan maichâma hâlral thilhlan hlân tûr chuan thu a pe a. Tin, hâlral thilhlan an han hlan ṭan chuan Lalpa hla chu tawtawrâwt leh Israel lal Davida siam thil tum rîk nên an sa ṭan bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan Pathian chibai an bûk a, hla satute chuan hla an sa a, tawtawrâwt hâmtute chuan an hâm a, hâlral thilhlan hlan zawh hma loh chuan chutiang chuan an ti reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, thilhlan an hlan zawh chuan lal leh a hnêna awm ve zawng zawngte chuan kûnin Pathian chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Lal Hezekia leh mi liante chuan Levi-hote chu Davida leh zâwlnei Asapha phuah fakna hla sa tûrin thu an pe a. Tin, hlim takin fakna hla an sa a, an kûn a, Pathian chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hezekia chuan, “ Lalpa tân in intithianghlim ta a, lo hnai ula, Lalpa inah inthawina leh lâwmthu sawina thilhlan rawn hlân rawh u khai,” a ti a. Tîn, mipuite chuan inthawina te, lâwmthu sawina thilhlante an rawn hlân a, a duh apiangin hâlral thilhlan an rawn hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, mipuiin hâlral thilhlan an rawn hlan zât chu bâwngpa sawmsarih leh berâmpa za leh berâmno zahnih a ni; hêng zawng zawng hi Lalpa tâna hâlral thilhlan vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thilhlan zawng zawng chu bâwngpa zaruk, berâmpa sângthum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, puithiam an tlêm lutuk a, hâlral thilhlan chu an lip sêng lo va; chuvângin, an unau Levi-hote chuan, an peih hma chuan puithiamte chu an intihthianghlim thlengin an puibâwm a (Levi-hote chu puithiamhote ai mahin intihthianghlim thûah an khermei zâwk si a).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, hâlral thilhlante chu a tam êm a, hâlral thilhlan tin atâna remna thilhlan thau te, in tûr thilhlan atân te pawh a tam êm êm bawk a. Chutichuan, Lalpa in rawngbâwl dân an tifel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipuite tâna Pathianin a buatsaih thil avâng chuan Hezekia leh mi zawng zawng chu an lâwm êm êm a; rin loh taka thil lo awm thut a ni lehnghâl si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chuan Israel ram leh Judai ram zawng zawngah mi a tîr a, Ephraim ram leh Manase ramahte pawh, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian tâna Kalhlên Kût nei tûra Jerusalem-a Lalpa ina lo kal tûrin lehkha a thawn bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal leh a mi liante leh Jerusalem-a mipui zawng zawng chuan thla hnihnaah Kalhlên Kût neih an rawt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan puithiam intithianghlimte an la tam tâwk lo va, Jerusalem-a mipui an la pun khâwm loh avângin an la kût thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thil ruat chu lal leh mipuiho ngaihin a dik a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel ram zawng zawng, Beer-seba aṭanga Dan thlengin Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian tâna Kalhlên Kût nei tûra Jerusalem-a lo kal tûra puan tûrin thu an tinghet ta a; a dân ang tak chuan chutianga tam chuan an la ti ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, lehkha tlânpuitute chu lal leh a mi lianhote lehkha kengin, Israel leh Judai ram zawng zawnga kal tûrin lal thupêk angin an chhuak a, “Nangni Israela thlahte u, Suria lalte kut ata chhuaka la dam chhunte lam chu a lo hawi leh theih nân Lalpa - Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Israela te Pathian lam chu rawn hawi leh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangni zawng in pi leh pute leh in unaute, Lalpa an pi leh pute Pathian chunga thil tisuala an awma, ṭiau tûra a thlahthlam tâk in hmuhte ang chuan awm ve suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In pi leh pute ang khân tihmawh ve tawh suh ula, Lalpa hnênah intulût zâwk ula, kumkhua atâna a tihthianghlim, a hmun thianghlimah chuan lo lût ula, Lalpa in Pathian rawng chu bâwl rawh u; tichuan, a thinurna nasa tak chu in lak ata a kiantîr dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa lam in lo hawi leh zawngin in unaute leh in fate chu sala mantute chuan an khawngaih ang a, he ramah hian an lo kal leh dâwn nia: Lalpa in Pathian chu ngilnei tak leh zahngai thei tak a ni si a, a lam in hawi phawt chuan a hawisan lo vang che u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, lehkha tlânpuitute chu khaw tinah Ephraim leh Manase ram zawng zawngah Zebulun thlengin an kal a: nimahsela, anni chuan an lo nuihzatbûr a, an lo hmusit a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Aser-ho leh Manase-ho leh Zebulun-ho ṭhenkhatin an bengkhawn a, Jerusalem-ah chuan an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judai ram te phei chu Lalpa thûa lal leh mi lianhote thupêk chu zâwm tûrin Pathianin rilru hmun khat a puttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, thla hnihnaah chuan chhang dawidim telh loh kût nei tûrin mi tam tak Jerusalem-ah chuan an lo pung khâwm chiam a, an tam ngei mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, an tho va, Jerusalem-a maichâmte chu an la a; tin, rimtui hâlna maichâmte pawh an la a, Kidron luiah an paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, thla hnihna ni sâwm leh ni li ni chuan Kalhlên Kûtna chu an talh a; tin, puithiamte leh Levi-ho chu an inzahpui a, an intithianghlim a, hâlral thilhlan chu Lalpa inah an la lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Pathian mi Mosia dân ang takin an hmun ṭheuhvah an ding a; tin, puithiamte chuan Levi-ho aṭanga an dawn thisen chu an theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipui zîngah chuan intithianghlim lo an tam si a; chuvângin, Lalpa tâna tithianghlim tûrin a thianghlim lo apiangte pualah Levi-hote chuan Kalhlên Kûtna an talh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ephraim mi te, Manase mi te, Isakar mi te, Zebulun mi tam takte chu an intithianghlim lo na a, dân lo angin Kalhlên Kûtna chu an ei ve a. Hezekian, “Tu pawh an thinlunga Pathian Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian zawngtu apiangte chu hmun thianghlim dân ang takin intithianghlim lo mah sela, Lalpa ngilnei taka chuan ngaidam ṭheuh rawh se,” tiin a ṭawngṭaisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Hezekia ṭawngṭaina chu a ngaithla a, mipuite chu a tidam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Israel mi Jerusalem-a awmte chuan chhang dawidim telh loh kût chu hlim takin ni sarih an hmang a; tin, Levi-ho leh puithiamho chuan ṭingṭang ring tak nêna Lalpa chawimawia hla sain ni tin Lalpa an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chuan thiam tak maia Lalpa mawi taka faktu Levi-hote chu a lo thlamuan a. Chutichuan, Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian hnêna thupha chawiin, remna thilhlante hlânin ni sarih chhûng chu kût ruai an ṭheh ṭumtla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, mipui chuan ni sarih dang kût leh an rawt a; tichuan, ni sarih dang hlim takin an kût leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Hezekia chuan mipuite chu bâwngpa sângkhat leh berâm sângsarih talh atân a pe a; mi lianhote pawhin mipuite chu bâwngpa sângkhat leh berâm sîngkhat an pe bawk a; puithiam tam tak an intithianghlim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Juda mipui zawng zawng chu puithiamte nên, Levi-hote nên, Israel ram aṭanga mipui lo kal zawng zawngte leh hnam dang Israel ram aṭanga lo kal Judai rama awmte chu an hlim êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, hlimna ropui tak Jerusalem-ah chuan a awm a; Israel lal Davida fapa Solomona chinah chutiang rêng rêng chu Jerusalem-ah a la awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiam Levi-hote chu an tho va, mipuite chu mal an sâwm a, an aw chu ngaihthlâkin a awm a, an ṭawngṭaina chuan a awmna thianghlim vân chu a thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chûng zawng zawng chu an tih zawh chuan chuta Israel mi awm zawng zawng chuan, Judai ram zawng zawng leh Benjamin ram leh Ephraim leh Manase rama mi lungphunte an tisawm a, Aseri-te an kit a, hmun sângte leh maichâmte an tihchim vek hma loh chuan Judai ram khuaahte an kal zêl a. Tin, Israela thlahte zawng zawng chu an ramah mahni khaw lam ṭheuhvah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chuan puithiamte leh Levi-hote chu an pâwl dân ang zêlin mi tin puithiamte leh Levi-hoten an thawh ṭheuh tûrin, hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan hlântu atân te, rawngbâwltu atân te, lâwmthu sawitu leh Lalpa awmna kawngkaa vêngtu tûrte pâwl a siamsak hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa dâna chuang angin zîng lam leh tlai lam hâlral thilhlan atân te, Chawlhni leh thla thar leh hunbi nei kût atânte lal chanvo atân ran a ruat bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem-a mipuite chu Lalpa dâna an intihchak nân puithiamte leh Levi-hote chanpual pe tûrin thu a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, thupêk chu a han darh veleh chuan Israela thlahte chuan an buh te, uain te, hriak te, khawizu te, an lova thil haw hmasa berte an rawn pe chiam a; tin, an engkim sâwma pakhat an rawn pe chiam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte leh Juda thlahte, Juda khuatea awmho chuan an bâwng leh berâm sâwma pakhat te, Lalpa an Pathian puala an voh sâwma pakhat te an rawn pe a, an dah khâwm ṭeuh mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thla thumnaah an dah khâwm ṭan a, thla sarihnaah an dah khâwm zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia leh an mi lianten an han hmuh chuan Lalpa leh a mi Israel-te chu an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hezekian an thil dah khâwm chungchâng thu chu puithiamho leh Levi-hote chu a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Zadok mi, puithiam hotu Azarian a chhâng a, “Miten Lalpa ina thilpêk an rawn lâk tirh aṭangin kan ei zêl a, kan khawpkham hle a, a la awm rui mai a; Lalpan a mite mal a sâwm zêl a, hemi la awm rui hi kan ei bâng a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hezekian Lalpa inah chuan pindante siam tûrin thu a pe a; tichuan, an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, thilpêk te, sâwma pakhat te, Pathian pualte chu rinawm takin an thiar lût a; an hotu chu Levi mi Konania a ni a, a unau Simeia chu a dawttu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Konania leh a unau Simeia hnuaiah chuan Lal Hezekia leh Pathian ina hotu Azaria ruatin endiktu Jehiela te, Azazia te, Nahatha te, Asahela te, Jerimotha te, Jozabada te, Eliela te, Ismakia te, Mahatha te, Benaia te an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Levi mi Imna fapa Korea, chhak lam kawngkhâr vêngtu chu Pathian hnêna mahni duh thûa thilpêk enkawltu leh Lalpa tân thilpêk leh thil thianghlim semtu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ama hnuaiah, puithiam awmna khuaahte chuan Edena te, Miniamina te, Jesua te, Semaia te, Amaria te, Sekania te an awm leh a, chûng chuan an unaute chu a pâwl pâwlin a lian leh a tête hnênah an chanvo tûr an sem bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />thlahtua ngaih mipa kum thum achin chung lam, ni tina Lalpa ina thawh tûr mamawh nei an pâwl dân ang zêla kal ṭhînte tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puithiamte hna inchhâwk dân tûr chu a chi chiin an ruat a, Levia chite erawh chu kum sawmhnih achin chung lam a pâwl pâwlin an ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puithiamte chu an nupui te, an fapa te, an fanu te leh an chhûngkuaa mi dangte nên rinawm taka an intihthianghlim reng avângin chhinchhiah vek an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Arona thlah, khaw tin daifêma awm puithiamte leh Levi-ho thlahte ziaknaa chuang apiangte chanvo pe tûrin mi ruat bîk an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, chutiang chuan Judai ram zawng zawngah Hezekian a ti a. Lalpa a Pathian mit hmuha ṭha leh dik leh rinawm thil a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian ina rawngbâwl lam thûah te, dân lam thûah te, thupêk lam thûah te, a Pathian zawn thûah te, a tih apiangah a rilru zawng zawngin a ti a, a hmuingîl ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutianga rinawm taka thil an tih hnu chuan Assuria lal Senakeriba a lo thawk a, Judai ramah chuan a lo lût a, kulh nei khuate chu a rawn hual a, lâk a rawn tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Senakeriba a lo thawk a, Jerusalem rawn beih a tum tih Hezekian a hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />khaw pâwn lama tuite chu tihchah tûrin a mi liante leh a mi chakte chu a râwn a; tichuan, an ṭanpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi tam tak an pung khâwm a, tui zawng zawng leh ram chhûnga luang tlang luite chu an dang chat a, “Assuria lalte chu an lo luha, tui tam tak engah nge an rawn neih tehlul ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, a intihuai a, kulh chim lai zawng zawng chu a siam a, in sângte a din ṭha a, pâwn lam kulhte pawh. Tin, Davida khuaa Milo chu a tinghet a, hriamhreite leh phawte tam tak a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, indonaa mipui hotute a siam a, khawpui kawngkhâr hmun zau laiah a ko khâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Chak tak leh huai takin awm rawh u; Assuria lal leh a hote mipui chu hlau suh ula, zâm hek suh u; kan lama ṭang chu a lama ṭang aiin a chak zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lama ṭang chu tisa sipai an ni a; min pui tûr leh mi dosak tûra kan lama ṭang erawh chu Lalpa kan Pathian a ni si a,” tiin thlamuanna thu a sawi a. Tin, mipui chuan Juda lal Hezekia thusawite chu an ring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Assuria lal Senakeriba chuan (amah leh a sipaite chu Lakis-ah an awm a) Juda lal Hezekia leh Jerusalem-a Juda mi zawng zawngte hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Assuria lal Senakeriba chuan heti hian a ti, ‘Jerusalem lâk chu eng nge ni in han rin lohna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hezekia chuan, “ Lalpa kan Pathianin Assuria lal kut ata min chhan chhuak ang,” tiin rilṭâm leh tuihâla in thihna mai tûrin a thlêm che u a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hezekia bawk hi a ni lâwm ni, a hmun sângte leh a maichâmte tichima Juda mi leh Jerusalem-a mite hnêna, “Maichâm pakhatah Pathian in bia ang a, rimtui in hâl ang,” tia thu petu kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei leh ka puten ram tin hnam tin chunga kan thiltihte kha in hre lo vem ni? Eng hnam pathian mahin ka kut ata an ram chu an humsak thei lo a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu hnam pathian nge ka puten an tihboral ka kut ata an mite chhan chhuak thei awma, nangni Pathian pawhin ka kut ata a han chhan chhuah theih bîkna tûr che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, Hezekia chuan bum che u suh sela, chutiang chuan thlêm che u suh sela, amah chu ring suh u; eng hnam pathian leh eng ram pathian mah an mite ka kut ata leh ka pute kut ata chhan chhuak thei an awm lo va; engtin nge in Pathian chuan ka kut ata a chhan chhuah theih bîk tehlul ang che u?’ ” tiin Jerusalem-ah a mite a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a mite chuan chu aia nasa chuan Lalpa Pathian leh a chhiahhlawh Hezekia chungchâng thu a ṭha lo lamin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Israel-te Lalpa , Pathian chawk thinur zâwng leh a sawi chhe zâwngin lehkha a ziak bawk a, “Ram tin, hnam tin pathianten ka kut ata an mite an chhan chhuak thei lo ang bawkin, Hezekia Pathian pawhin ka kut ata a mite a chhan chhuak tawp lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, khua chu an lâk theih nân a râp tûr leh timangang tûrin Jerusalem-a kulha awmte chu Juda ṭawngin ring takin an au khum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem Pathian chu mihring kuta siam, khawvêl pathian ang lekfangin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Hezekia leh Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaia chu chumi avâng chuan an ṭawngṭai a, vâna mi an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan vântirhkoh a tîr a, chu chuan Assuria lal riahhmuna mi chak huaisen zawng zawng te, hma hruaitu hotute chu a tihlum a. Tichuan, zak tak hmêl puin a ram lamah a haw leh ta a. Tin, a pathian ina a va kal chu ama rîla rahte ngeiin khandaihin an lo tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Lalpan Hezekia leh Jerusalem-a mite chu, Assuria lal Senakeriba kut ata leh mi dang zawng zawng kut ata chu a chhan him a, an vêla mite lakah a vêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, mi tam takin Jerusalem-ah Lalpa tân thilpêk an rawn la a, thil hlu tak takte Juda lal Hezekia chu an rawn pe a; chuta ṭang chuan hnam tin mit hmuhah chawimawiin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Hezekia chu thih ngamin a na a, Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a; tin, a lo chhâng a, chhinchhiahna a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, Hezekia chuan a tâna ṭha tûra tih ang chuan a ti lo va, a rilru a lo chapo tâk avângin; chuvângin, a chungah leh Juda-te leh Jerusalem chungah thinurna a lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Hezekia chuan a rilru chapona chu inchhîrin a inngaitlâwm leh a, amah leh Jerusalem-a mite nên; tichuan, Hezekia dam chhûng chuan Lalpa thinurna chu an chungah a thleng ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chuan sum leh pai a lo ngah a, a lo ropui ta hle mai a; tangkarua te, rangkachak te, lunghlu te, rimtui te, phaw te leh bungbêl ṭha tak tak dah khâwmna in a sa a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />buh te, uain te, hriak te dah khâwmna in pawh a sa bawk a; tin, ran tinrêng dahna leh berâm huangte a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, khuate pawh a siam bawk a, berâm rual leh bâwng rual a ngah êm êm mai a; Pathianin neinung takin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hezekia bawk hian Gihon lui tui chhakta zâwk a tiping a, Davida khaw thlang lampangah a luan thlâktîr bawk a. Tichuan, Hezekia chu a thiltih zawng zawngah chuan a hmuingil zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Babulon mi lianten palaia an tirha a rama thilmak an zawh thûah chuan, a rilrua awm zawng zawng a hriat theih nân Pathianin thlahthlamin a fiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hezekia thiltih dang zawng zawng te, a thil tihṭhat te chu, ngai teh, Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaia inlârna bu, Juda lal leh Israel lalte chanchin buah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, Davida fapate thlân hmun chhohnaah an phûm a; Juda-te zawng zawng leh Jerusalem-a mite chuan a thih ni chuan ropui takin an chawimawi a. Tin, a fapa Manasea chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasea chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sâwm leh kum hnih a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmnga leh kum nga a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo, Israela thlahte hmaa Lalpan a hnawh chhuah Pathian hre lo hnamten thil tenawm tak an tih ang chu a ti ve ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Hezekian a tihchim hnu hmun sângte a din ṭha a, Baala-te tân maichâmte a din a, Aseri lemte a siam a, vâna awm zawng zawng khi a bia a, an rawng te a bâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Jerusalem-ah kumkhuain ka hming a awm ang,” Lalpan a tihna Lalpa inah chuan maichâmte a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in hung chhûng kawtlai pahnihah chuan vâna awm zawng zawng tân maichâmte a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinoma fapa ruamah meiah a fate chu a luhtîr a; aien te a chîng a, dawi te a hmang a, ramhuai aienthiam zâwlte leh dawithiamte a ruai ṭhîn a; Lalpa tithinur tûrin a mit hmuha thil ṭha lo a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Davida leh a fapa Solomona hnêna, “He in leh Jerusalem khua, Israel chi zawng zawng zînga ka thlanah hian ka hming chu kumkhuain ka awmtîr ang a; thu ka pêk zawng zawng leh dân zawng zawng te, thuruat te, thiltih tûr Mosia hmanga ka pêkte kha an zawm phawt chuan, an pi leh pute ka pêk tawh ram ata chu Israel-hote ke chu ka pên chhuahtîr tawh lo vang,” a lo tih tawhna Pathian inah chuan ama siam, milem siam chawp a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Manasea chuan Juda-te leh Jerusalem-a mite chu thil a tihsualtîr a; tichuan, Lalpan Israel-te hmaa a tihboral tâk hnamte ai mahin thil an tisual zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Manasea leh a mite hnênah thu a sawi ṭhîn a; nimahsela, an ngaihsak lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Lalpan Assuria sipai hotute a tîr a, Manasea chu khaidiatin an hlîng a, kawl an buntîr a, Babulon-ah an kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mangang taka a awm lai chuan Lalpa a Pathian chu a zawng a, a pi leh pute Pathian hmaah chuan nasa takin a intihnuai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, khawngaih a hlawh a, a dîlna chu a ngaihthlâksak a, Jerusalem-ah a ramah chuan a hruai leh ta a. Tichuan, Manasea chuan Lalpa chu Pathian a nih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Davida khaw pâwn lama Gihon thlang lampang ruamah Sangha Kawngkhâr luhna thlengin kulh a siam a, Ophel hual vêlin sâng takin a din a; tin, Juda khua kulh nei zawng zawngah chuan hotu huaisen tak takte a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ram dang pathiante leh milemte chu Lalpa in ata a thehthang bo va, Lalpa in tlâng leh Jerusalem-a maichâm a siam zawng zawng chu khua ata an paih vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa maichâm a siam a, remna thilhlan inthawina te, lâwm thu sawina te a hlân a, Juda-te chu Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian rawngbâwl tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipuite chu hmun sângahte chuan an la inthawi reng a; amaherawhchu, Lalpa an Pathian hnênah chauh a ni ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manasea chanchin dang zawng zawng te, a Pathian hnêna a ṭawngṭai thûte, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian hminga zâwlneiin a hnêna thu an sawi thute chu, ngai teh, Israel lalte chanchin zîngah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ṭawngṭaina te leh Pathianin a khawngaihna leh a intihhnuai hmaa a sualna zawng zawng leh hmun sâng a siama, Aseri leh milem siam chawp a dinna hmun zawng zawng pawh, ngai teh, Hozaia chanchin ziakna buah a chuang vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Manasea chu a pi leh pute hnênah a muhîl a, ama inah an phûm a. Tichuan, a fapa Amona chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amona chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum hnih a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawm hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pa Manasea tih ang bawkin Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo a ti a; a pa Manasean a siam milem siam chawp zawng zawng hnênah Amona chu a inthawi a, an rawng a bâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pa Manasea a intihnuai ang khân Lalpa hmaah a intihnuai ve lo va. Amona hi chu a sual zual sauh sauh mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a chhiahhlawhten an phiar a, ama inah an tihlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, Amona phiartu zawng zawng chu mipuiin an that ve vek a. Tichuan, mipuite chuan a fapa Josia chu a aiah lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josia chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum riat mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmthum leh kum khat a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuhah thil ṭha a ti ṭhîn a, a pu Davida kawngte a zawh a, ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw a pênsan lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum riat a lal kum, naupang tak a la nih lai aṭang rêngin a pu Davida Pathian a zawng ṭan a; tin, kum sâwm leh kum hnih a lal kumin Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a hmun sâng te, Aseri te, milem siam chawp te, milem chhûn chawpte a thian fai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Baala maichâmte chu a mit hmuhah an tichim a; tin, chûng aia sânga ni lemte chu a kit a; Aseri te, milem siam chawp te, milem chhûn chawpte chu a tisawm dep a, an hnêna inthawi ṭhînte thlân chungah a theh darh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puithiamte ruh chu an maichâmahte a hâl a, Judai ram leh Jerusalem chu a thian fai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chutiang bawk chuan Manase te, Ephraim te, Simeon te, Naphtali khuate lamin a ti vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, maichâmte a tichim a, Aseri te, milem siam chawpte chu a tisawm dep a, Israel ram zawng zawnga ni lemte chu a kit vek a, Jerusalem-ah a haw leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a lal kum sâwm leh kum riat kum, a ram leh inte a then fai kum chuan Azalia fapa Saphana te, khaw awptu Maaseia te, Joahaza fapa lehkhaziaktu Joa te chu Lalpa a Pathian in siam ṭha tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Hilkia hnênah an kal a, kawngkhâr vêngtu Levi-hoten Manase mi te, Ephraim mi te, Israel-ho la awm chhun te, Juda mi leh Benjamin mi te, Jerusalem-a mite hnên ata an lo lâk khâwm, Pathian ina an rawn dah tangka chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in satu hnathawktute an pe a; tin, Lalpa in hnathawktute chuan in siam ṭhatute leh cheitute an pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda lalten an lo tihchhiat tâk in siam ṭhat nân lung chher te, a zawmna te leh a khanchhukte atâna thing lei nân themthiamte leh in satute chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mite chuan hna chu rinawm takin an thawk a; an hotu, hnathawh rêlbâwltute chu, Meraria fapate zînga Levi mi Jahatha leh Obadia te, Kohath mi fapate zînga mi Zekaria leh Mesulama-te an ni a; tin, Levi mi mi dang, thil tum thiam zawng zawngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A phurha phur mite hotu pawh an ni a, hna tinrêng thawktute thawh tûr rêlbâwltu an ni. Lehkhaziaktu te, hotu te, kawngkhâr vêngtute chu Levi mite zînga mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ina an rawn dah sumte an han phawrh chuan, puithiam Hilkia chuan Mosia hmanga pêk Lalpa dân bu chu a hmu chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Hilkia chuan lehkhaziaktu Saphana hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa inah dân bu kan hmu chhuak ta,” a ti a. Tin, Hilkia chuan lehkhabu chu Saphana a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Saphana chuan lehkhabu chu lal hnênah a kalpui a, “I chhiahhlawhten tih tûra ruat zawng zawng chu an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa ina tangka awm chu an bun chhuak a, hotute leh hnathawktute chu an pe a,” tiin thu a thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktu Saphana chuan, “Puithiam Hilkia chuan lehkhabu mi pe,” tiin lal chu a hrilh bawk a. Tin, Saphana chuan lal hmaah a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, lalin dân thute chu a han hriat chuan a puan a pawt thlêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Kal ula, dân thu in hmuh chhuah chungchâng thûah hian, keimah leh Israel leh Judai rama mite tân Lalpa min va râwnsak teh u; kan pi leh puten he dân bua chuang ang hian Lalpa thu chu an lo zawm loh avâng hian, kan chungah Lalpa thinurna chu a lo awm nasa ta a ni si a,” tiin Hilkia te, Saphana fapa Ahikama te, Mika fapa Abdona te, lehkhaziaktu Saphana te, lal chhiahhlawh Asaia te chu thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, lalin thu a pêkate leh Hilkia chu, silhfên enkawltu Hasra fa Tokhatha fapa Saluma nupui zâwlnei Huldi hnênah chuan an va kal a, chumi thûah chuan an va bia a (Ani chu Jerusalem Misne-a awm a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Ka hnêna rawn tîrtu che u chu hrilh ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh u, he hmun leh a chhûnga awmte chungah hian thil ṭha lo ka thlentîr ang a, Juda lal hmaa an chhiar chhuah tâk lehkhabua chuang ânchhia zawng zawngte pawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />an kut thiltiha min tihthinur nâna min hawisana, pathian dangte tâna rimtui an hâl avângin he hmun chungah hian ka thinurna leih a ni a, tihdaih a ni lo vang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpa râwn tûra rawn tîrtu che u Juda lal hnênah chuan hetiang hian sawi ang che u, ‘ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Chûng thu i hriatte chuan i thinlung a tihnêm avânga Pathian hmaa i intihhniama, he hmun chungchâng thu leh a chhûnga awmte chungchâng thu i hriata, ka hmaa i intihhnuaia, i puan i pawh thlêra, ka hmaa i ṭah avângin kei pawhin i thu chu ka lo ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngai teh, i pi leh i pute hnênah ka kaltîr ang chia, i thlânah thlamuang takin i kal ang a, he hmun leh a chhûnga awmte chunga ka rawn thlentîr tûr thil ṭha lo zawng zawngte chu i mitin a hmu lo vang,’ tiin, ti rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, lal hnênah thu chu an thlen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan mi a tîr a, Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a upa zawng zawng chu a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, lal leh Juda mi zawng zawng, Jerusalem-a mi zawng zawng te, puithiam leh Levi-ho te, mipuiho zawng zawng a lian a têin Lalpa inah an chho va; Lalpa ina an hmuh chhuah thuthlung bua thu zawng zawng chu an beng hriatah a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a hmunah a ding a, chumi lehkhabua chuang thuthlung thu chu tinghet tûrin, a thinlung zawng zawng leh thlarau zawng zawnga Lalpa zui tûr leh a thupêk te, a thuhriattîr te, a thuruatte pawm tûrin Lalpa hmaah chuan thu an thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem leh Benjamin mi zawng zawng chu chutianga awm tûrin a ti a. Tin, Jerusalem-a mite chuan Pathian, an pi leh pute Pathian thuthlung ang chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Josia chuan, Israel ramin a huam zawng zawng ata thil tenawm zawng zawng chu a thehthang bo va, Israel rama awm zawng zawng chu Lalpa an Pathian rawng a bâwltîr a. Tin, a dam chhûng chuan Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian an zui chu an pênsan lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Josia chuan Jerusalem-ah Lalpa tân Kalhlên Kût a nei a; Kalhlên Kûtna tûr chu thla khatna, ni sâwm leh ni li nîah an talh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte chu an hnathawh a ruatsak a, Lalpa ina rawngbâwl hna thawk tûrin a fuih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite zirtîrtu, Pathian tâna tihhran Levi-hote hnênah chuan, “Israel lal Davida fapa Solomona in sakah chuan bâwm thianghlim chu dah rawh u; in kokia zâwn a ngai tawh lo vang; Lalpa in Pathian leh a mi Israel-te rawng bâwl tawh rawh u khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal Davida ziak ang leh a fapa Solomona ziak angin, in chhûngkaw puipa zir zêlin a pâwl pâwlin inbuatsaih rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, in unauteho chhûngkaw puipa zir zêlin Levi-hote puala chanvo neiin hmun thianghlimah chuan awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kalhlên kûtna tûr talh ula, intithianghlim ula, Mosia hmanga Lalpa sawi anga ti tûrin in unaute tân buatsaih rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Josian chuta mi awm zawng zawng chu Kalhlên Kûta hlan tûrin ran rual zînga mi berâmno leh kêlno sîngthum leh bâwngpa sângthum a pe a; chûngte chu lal sum zînga mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a mi liante chuan mipui te, puithiam te, Levi-hote chu mahni duh thûa hlan atân an pe a. Pathian in hotu Hilkia te, Zekaria te, Jehiela te chuan Kalhlên Kûta hlan tûrin ran no sânghnih leh zaruk leh bâwngpa zathum puithiamte an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Konania te, a unau Semaia leh Nethanela te, Levi-hote hotu Hasabia te, Zeiela te, Jozabada te pawhin Kalhlên Kûta hlan atân Levi-hote chu ran no sângnga leh bâwngpa zanga an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, rawngbâwlna chu an buatsaih a, lal thupêk angin puithiamte chu an hmunah an ding a, Levi-hote chu an pâwl dân ang zêlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Kalhlên Kûtna tûr chu an talh a, puithiamte chuan thisen chu an theh a, Levi-hote chuan an lip a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mosia lehkhabua chuang anga an chhûngkaw ṭhen dân zir zêla Lalpa hnêna hlan atâna pêk tûrin, hâlral thilhlante chu an la sawn a. Bâwngpate pawh chu chutiang bawk chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Kalhlên Kûtna tûr chu dân angin an hem hmin a; tin, thilhlan thianghlim sa chu bêl te, bêl khaina nei te, bêl rawng zautein an chhûm kawi a, mi zawng zawng hnênah an kalpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chumi zawhah chuan anmahni leh puithiamte tân an buatsaih a; Arona fa puithiamte chu hâlral thilhlan leh sa thau hlânin zân thlengin an buai si a; chuvângin, Levi-hote chuan anmahni leh Arona fa puithiamte tân an buatsaih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Davida leh Asapha leh Hemana leh lal zâwlnei Jeduthuna-te thupêk angin, hla satu Asapha fapate chu an hmunah an ding a; tin, kawngkhâr vêngtute chu kawngkhâr tinah an awm a; an unau Levi-hoten an buatsaihsak avângin an hna kalsan a ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Josia thupêk anga Kalhlên Kût nei tûr leh Lalpa maichâma hâlral thilhlan hlân tûrin, chumi ni vêk chuan Lalpa rawngbâwlna thil zawng zawng chu an buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlah chuta awmte chuan chumi ni chuan kalhlên kût an nei a, chhang dawidim telh loh kût pawh ni sarih an nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zâwlnei Samuela dam lai ata Israel ramah Kalhlên Kût chutiang rêng rêng chu an nei ngai lo va; Israel lal tu mahin Josia leh puithiamte leh, Levi-hote leh Juda zawng zawng leh, Israel-te leh Jerusalem-a miten an neih anga nei an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh kum riat Josia a lal kumin chu Kalhlên Kût chu an nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng hnua Josian biak in a buatsaih zawh chuan, Aigupta lal Nekoa chu Karkhemis bei tûrin Euphrates luiah a han chho va; tin, Josia chuan a han bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan, “Nang Juda lal, kei leh nang eng nge kan intihna tûr awm? Nang bei tûrin ka lo kal lo va, ka do laite bei tûr zâwkin asin ni ka lo kal; Pathianin hmanhmawh tûrin thu min pe a, ka lama ṭang Pathian chu dodâl suh khai, a tiboral dah ang che,” tiin palai a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Josia chuan a kîrsan duh lo va, a do theih nân a inbâwl danglam a, Pathian kâ aṭanga Nekoa thusawi chu a pawm lo va, Megido ruamah lo bei tûrin a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, thal kâp mite chuan Josia chu an han kâp a; tin, lal chuan a chhiahhlawhte hnênah, “Min kal bopui rawh u, hliam nasa tak ka tâwk ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, a chhiahhlawhte chuan tawlailîr ata chu an la chhuak a, a tawlailîr dangah chuan an dah a, Jerusalem-ah an kalpui a, a thi a, a pi leh pute thlânah an phûm ta a. Juda mi zawng zawng leh Jerusalem-a miten Josia chu an sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jeremia chuan Josia chu a ṭah a. Tin, hla satu hmeichhia leh mipate chuan tûn thlengin Josia an ṭah hla chu an la chham a. Israel ramah chuan dânah an neih a, ngai teh, ṭah hlaah chuan a chuang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josia thiltih dang zawng zawng, Lalpa dâna chuang anga a thiltih ṭha te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a hmasa ber leh a hnuhnûng berte pawh, ngai teh, Israel lal leh Juda lalte chanchin buah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi rama mite chuan Josia fapa Joahaza chu an hruai a, Jerusalem-ah a pa aiah lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joahaza chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum thum a ni a, Jerusalem-ah thla thum a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta lalin Jerusalem-a a lalna a bân a, an ram chu tangkaraw talent za leh rangkachak talent khat a chawitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta lal chuan a unaupa Eliakima chu Juda leh Jerusalem-a lalah a siam a, a hming chu Jehoiakima tiin a thlâksak a. Tin, Nekoa chuan a unaupa Joahaza chu Aigupta ramah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakima chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum nga a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum khat a lal a; Lalpa a Pathian mit hmuha thil ṭha lo a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara chu amah bei tûrin a lo thawk a, Babulon-a hruai tûrin kawl a buntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nebukadnezzara chuan Lalpa in bungbêlte pawh Babulon-ah a la a, Babulon-a a pathian biak inah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakima chanchin dang te, a thil tenawm tih te leh a awm dânte chu, ngai teh, Israel lal leh Juda lalte chanchin buah a chuang a. Tichuan, a fapa Jehoiakina chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiakina chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum riat mi a ni a, Jerusalem-ah thla thum leh ni sâwm a lal a; Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum a lo vei chuan Lal Nebukadnezzara chuan mi a tîr a, Lalpa ina bungbêl ṭha tak takte nên Babulon-ah a hruaitîr a, a unaupa Zedekia chu Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a lalah a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zedekia chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum khat a ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum khat a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa a Pathian mit hmuha thil ṭha lo a ti ṭhîn a; Lalpa kâ aṭanga thu sawitu zâwlnei Jeremia lakah chuan a intihnuai duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian hminga chhechhamtîrtu Lal Nebukadnezzara chungah a hel bawk a; luhlul a chhuah a, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian lam hawi lo tûrin a rilru a tikhauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puithiam hotu zawng zawng leh mipuite pawhin Pathian hre lo mite tih ang bawk thil tenawm tak takte an ti a; Jerusalem-a a tihthianghlim Lalpa inte pawh chu an tibawlhhlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian chuan an hnênah theihpatâwpa ṭhahnemngaiin mi a tîr a, a mite leh a awmna hmun chu a lainat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian mi tirhte chu an hmusit a, a thute chu an ngainêp a, a mite chunga Lalpa thinurna chu a lo thawk a, tihlungawi lehna rêng awm lo khawp hialin a zâwlneite chu an tinawmnah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, Kaldai lal an chungah a thawhtîr a, ani chuan an tlangvâlte chu an hmun thianghlimah khandaihin a that a, nula leh tlangvâl pawh, tar pawh, tarchhia pawh lainatna rêng rêng a nei lo va; a kutah a pe vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Pathian ina bungbêl zawng zawng, a lian pawh, a tê pawh, Lalpa ina sum dah khâwm zawng zawng te, lal sum dah khâwm leh a mi liante sum dah khâwmte lamin Babulon-ah a la vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Pathian in te an hâl a, Jerusalem kulh te an tichim a, chuta in ropui zawng zawng chu an hâl a, chuta bungbêl ṭha mi zawng zawng chu an tichhe vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khandaiha thah bâng zawng zawng chu Babulon-ah a hruai a, amah leh a fapate chhiahhlawhah Persia-ho lo len thlengin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpan zâwlnei Jeremia hmanga thu a lo sawi Chawlhni serh thei lova an awm chhûng kum sawmsarih, Chawlhni an serh leh theih thlengin, ram chu tihchhiatin a awm ang, a tih kha a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Persia lal Kura lal tirh kumin Jeremia kâa Lalpa thu chu a thlen kim theih nân, a ram zawng zawnga than chhuak vek tûr leh, a ziaka ziak tûr pawhin Lalpan Persia lal Kura thinlung chu a chawk tho va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Persia lal Kura chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Khawvêl ram zawng zawng chu Lalpa , vân Pathian chuan min pe ta a; tin, Judai rama Jerusalem-ah chuan a in saksak tûrin thu mi pe a ni. In zînga ama mite tawh phawt hnênah chuan Lalpa a Pathian chu awm sela, han chho rawh se,’” tiin.
  </para>
</usx>
